msgid "**Company ready to invoice:** every deploy ensures the Company named `service_provider.company.titel` in the country `service_provider.company.address.country`, with the currency ERPNext's country data assigns to that country, plus a fiscal year for today, the tax accounts `VAT 19%`, `VAT 7%`, `VAT 20%`, `Reverse Charge` and `Export` under `Duties and Taxes` and a default cash account, so quotes, orders and invoices work right after the deploy. The abbreviation ERPNext appends to every account is `applications.web-app-erpnext.services.erpnext.company.abbr`, the initials of the company name unless the inventory sets it. A Company that already exists keeps its own values, and a country ERPNext does not know, such as the placeholder default, fails the deploy."
