msgid "**Directory login with group-based write access:** behind the oauth2-proxy gate, sign in with your directory user name (`LDAP_LOGIN_ATTR`, rendered from `LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES.ID`) and your password. phpLDAPadmin binds as your own entry for every request, and the `svc-db-openldap` ACL grants write access, `userPassword` included, to members of the `web-app-phpldapadmin` administrator group. Other accounts get read access and cannot read or set foreign passwords."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Directory login with group-based write access:** behind the oauth2-proxy gate, sign in with your directory user name (``LDAP_LOGIN_ATTR``, rendered from ``LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES.ID``) and your password. phpLDAPadmin binds as your own entry for every request, and the ``svc-db-openldap`` ACL grants write access, ``userPassword`` included, to members of the ``web-app-phpldapadmin`` administrator group. Other accounts get read access and cannot read or set foreign passwords."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Directory login:** LAM signs users in with \"LDAP search\": it looks up the typed user name under the users OU, admits only members of the `web-app-lam` administrator RBAC group, and binds as that user. `files/shell/entrypoint.sh` writes the search suffix and filter from `templates/env.j2` into the profile on every fresh container."
