# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice is dashboard-only.** The first implementation wires each agent through its web dashboard only. Chat-platform connectors (Telegram/Discord/Signal/...), which need operator-supplied bot tokens, are deferred to a follow-up and MUST NOT block the first green deploy."
msgstr "**Prvi kos je samo armaturna plošča.** Prvi implementacija žic vsak agent skozi svojo spletno armaturno ploščo samo. Priključki za govorno-platformno komunikacijo (Telegram/Discord/Signal/...), ki potrebujejo žetone za bot, dostavljene operaterju, se odložijo na nadaljnje ukrepanje in ne smejo blokirati prve zelene uporabe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice.** The first end-to-end migration is `web-app-friendica` (`ldapauth`, bridges `ldap` to `svc-db-openldap`), because it already exercises the bridge rule and the service-flag enablement path."
msgstr "**Prvi kos.** Prva migracija med koncema je `web-app-friendica` (`ldapauth`, mostovi `ldap` do `svc-db-openldap`), ker že izvaja pravilo mostu in servisno-zastava omogoča pot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First slice.** The first end-to-end slice is `web-app-baserow` (server) plus `web-app-openwebui` (client)."
msgstr "**Prvi kos.** Prvi kos od konca do konca je `web-app-baserow` (strežnik) plus `web-app-openwebui` (odjemalec)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**First-party asset delivery:** Browsers never contact third-party CDNs directly; the deployment fetches and caches assets server-side."
msgstr "**Dostava sredstev prve stranke:** Brskalniki se nikoli ne obrnejo neposredno na CDN tretjih oseb; uvajanje prinaša in predpomnilnik sredstev na strežniku."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Five-distro coverage:** Supports the five default CI distros (Archlinux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora, CentOS) without duplicated task code."
msgstr "**Pet-distro pokritost:** Podpira pet privzetih diskrov CI (Archlinux, Debian, Ubuntu, Fedora, CentOS) brez podvojene kode opravila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed Moodle redeploy failures** by stripping the trailing slash from *CFG->wwwroot* to prevent health check issues"
msgstr "**Fiksna Moodle napake pri prerazporejanju** z odstranjevanjem poševnice *CFG->wwwroot* preprečevanje zdravstvenih pregledov"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed**"
msgstr "**Fiksna**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fixed:** OpenProject migrations stabilized (simplified migration step; preload *CustomFieldContext* before *db:migrate*). Nextcloud LDAP config hardened and incompatible apps disabled in production. XWiki extension install hardened and one time seed ensures *Main.WebHome* exists. Matomo bootstrap fails fast on root cause. TLS and CA improvements (unified self signed CA env for health services, retries for CA trust override generation, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* improved on Fedora. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* build prerequisites and header fallback refactored; per user *password_update* policy added. Backup and ops fixes (OnlyOffice no restart during backups; backup home and ACL tasks more reliable). Container setup hardened (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo add, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker readiness and SSH restart improvements)."
msgstr "**Fiksno:** Migracije OpenProject stabilizirane (poenostavljen migracijski korak; predobremenitev *Po meriFieldContext* Pred uporabo *db: migrat*). Nextcloud LDAP konfig utrjene in nezdružljive aplikacije onemogočene v proizvodnji. XWiki razširitev namestitev utrjena in enkratno seme zagotavlja *Main.WebHome* Obstaja. Matomo škornji hitro propade pri koreninah. Izboljšanje TLS in CA (enotno samopodpisan CA env za zdravstvene storitve, rezerve za CA zaupanje prevladajo ustvarjanje, Nix TLS CA trust fix). *msmtp* Na Feodori. OpenLDAP *python-ldap* izdelati predpogoje in refaktorirati nazaj glavo; na uporabnika *password_update* dodana politika. Popravki varnostne kopije in operacij (OnlyOffice ni ponovnega zagona med backup; backup home in ACL naloge bolj zanesljiv). Nastavitev zabojnika utrjena (Fedora Docker CE CLI, dnf5 repo dodaj, Debian buildx conflict fix, Docker pripravljenost in SSH ponovno izboljšave)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flavor selectable:** one setting switches between Code - OSS, VSCodium and the Microsoft build."
msgstr "**Izbirna aroma:** eno nastavitev stikala med Code OSS, VSCodium in Microsoftova gradnja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Authentication:** Integrated support for OpenID Connect (OIDC) simplifies user login and enhances security."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva overovitev:** Integrirana podpora za OpenID Connect (OIDC) poenostavi uporabniško prijavo in izboljša varnost."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Client Support:** Access Matrix services via modern web clients like Element, plus integrated Element Call and Jitsi video conferencing."
msgstr "**Fleksibilna podpora strankam:** Dostop Matrix storitve prek sodobnih spletnih strank, kot so Element, plus integriran Element Call in Jitsi videokonference."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Configuration:**"
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Configuration:**   Adjust settings such as SSL options, port numbers, and server credentials through environment variables and templated configuration files."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev:** Prilagodite nastavitve, kot so možnosti SSL, številke vrat in poverilnice strežnikov, preko okoljskih spremenljivk in predlog konfiguracijskih datotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Configuration:** Customize cache sizes, domain settings, and authentication options via environment variables and templated configuration files."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev:** Prilagodite velikosti predpomnilnikov, nastavitve domen in možnosti avtentikacije prek okoljskih spremenljivk in s predlogo povezanih nastavitvenih datotek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Configuration:** Easily customize settings such as database connections, admin credentials, and server configurations via a TOML file."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev:** Enostavno prilagodite nastavitve, kot so povezave do zbirke podatkov, admin poverilnice, in server nastavitve prek datoteke TOML."

msgid "**Flexible Control:** Supports for `CLEANUP` for cert cleanup operations."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Flexible Control:** Supports for ``CLEANUP`` for cert cleanup operations."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible DB:** Use platform's central MariaDB or app-local DB."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiv DB:** Uporabi osrednjo platformo MariaDB ali lokalno aplikacijo DB."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible DB:** Use platform’s central MariaDB or app-local DB."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiv DB:** Uporabi osrednjo platformo MariaDB ali lokalno aplikacijo DB."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Deployment:** Easily scale and customize using Docker Compose, with configurable settings for networking, storage, and external services."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva razporeditev:** Enostavno merilo in prilagodite uporabo Docker Compose, z nastavljivimi nastavitvami za mreženje, shranjevanje in zunanje storitve."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Environment Configuration:**"
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev okolja:**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Environment Configuration:**   Customize your installation using environment variables and templated configuration files to match your infrastructure needs."
msgstr "**Prilagodljiva nastavitev okolja:** Prilagodite namestitev z uporabo okoljskih spremenljivk in predlog za nastavitvene datoteke, ki ustrezajo vašim infrastrukturnim potrebam."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Notification:** Supports handler notification for post-install actions (e.g., Docker Compose builds)."
msgstr "**Prilagodljivo obvestilo:** Podpira obveščanje upravljavca za ukrepe po namestitvi (Npr. Docker Compose gradniki)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Scheduling:** Supports configuration of parameters such as OnCalendar and RandomizedDelaySec for precise control over task timing."
msgstr "**Prilagodljivo načrtovanje:** Podpira konfiguracijo parametrov, kot so OnCalendar in RandomisedDelaySec za natančen nadzor nad časovnim razporedom opravil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible Schema Support:** Customize and extend directory schemas to meet diverse organizational requirements."
msgstr "**Fleksibilna shema podpore:** Prilagodite in razširiti imeniške sheme za izpolnitev različnih organizacijskih zahtev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flexible vHost templates**: *basic* and *ws_generic* flavours cover standard HTTP and WebSocket applications."
msgstr "**Fleksibilne predloge vHost**: *osnovni* ter *ws_generic* Okusi zajemajo standardne HTTP in WebSocket aplikacije."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise 3.1.4** is reconciled through the authenticated `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` routes with a scoped identity limited to `tools:create`, `tools:view`, `tools:update` and `tools:delete`. It registers only Streamable HTTP providers: its SSE fallback cannot complete a connection at this pin, so an SSE provider is reported incompatible rather than claimed as registered. The role builds its own image from the pinned npm package, because the published `flowiseai/flowise` tags `3.1.3`, `3.1.4` and `latest` all ship the `flowise` package at version 3.1.2, which serves none of the required routes. Internal connectivity is never solved by globally disabling SSRF protection for all flow authors."
msgstr "**Pretok 3.1.4** se uskladi z overjeno `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` proge z razširjeno identiteto, omejene na `tools:create`, `tools:view`, `tools:update` ter `tools:delete`. Registrira samo Streable HTTP ponudniki: njegova rezervna povezava SSE ne more dokončati povezave na tej pin, tako da se o ponudniku SSE poroča nezdružljivo, namesto da se trdi, da je registriran. Vloga gradi svojo podobo iz vezanega paketa NPM, ker je objavljena `flowiseai/flowise` značke `3.1.3`, `3.1.4` ter `latest` vse ladje `flowise` paket v različici 3.1.2, ki ne služi nobeni od zahtevanih poti. Notranje povezljivosti nikoli ne rešimo z globalno onesposobitvijo zaščite SSDF za vse avtorje toka."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise cross-agent supervisor is Phase 2, deferred.** The supervisor (Flowise as MCP client delegating to Hermes' MCP-server mode v0.6.0+ and OpenClaw's MCP-server, chaining cross-agent pipelines) is a separate later slice, not the first implementation. Rationale: it depends on the young hermes MCP-server mode and adds a second orchestration tier. The first slice ships each agent standalone; the supervisor design below is retained as the Phase 2 target. Single-agent use MUST always work without Flowise."
msgstr "**Pretočni navzkrižni nadzornik je faza 2, Odloženo.** Nadzornik (Flowise kot MCP odjemalec, ki prenaša na Hermesov MCP-server način v0.6.0+ in OpenClawMCP-server, verižni cevovodi) je ločen poznejši del, ne pa prva izvedba. Rationale: to je odvisno od mladega hermes MCP-server način in doda drugo orkestracijo stopnjo. Prvi del ladje vsak agent sam; spodnji model nadzornika se obdrži kot faza 2 Tarča. Enkratna uporaba mora vedno delovati brez Flowise."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise's published images do not contain the version their tag claims:** `3.1.3`, `3.1.4` and `latest` all ship `flowise` 3.1.2, because upstream's Dockerfile runs an unpinned `npm install -g flowise` whose layer the release CI reuses. The role builds from an explicit npm pin and verifies the served route set."
msgstr "**Objavljene slike Flowise ne vsebujejo različic njihovih trditev glede oznake:** `3.1.3`, `3.1.4` ter `latest` vsa ladja `flowise` 3.1.2, Ker Dockerjeva datoteka teče v toku. `npm install -g flowise` katerih plast sproščanja se ponovno uporabi. Vloga gradi iz eksplicitne npm pin in preveri servisirano pot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise's role-local LiteLLM is refactored into the shared role.** The role-local LiteLLM config and container in `web-app-flowise` (`templates/litellm.config.yaml.j2`, its compose service, related env) are removed; Flowise consumes `svc-ai-litellm` instead. No duplicated LiteLLM deployment remains. Flowise stays green after the refactor."
msgstr "**V skupno vlogo je refakturiran tudi lokalni LiteLLM.** Lokalna LiteLLM config in kontejner `web-app-flowise` (`templates/litellm.config.yaml.j2`, njegova komponirana storitev, sorodna env) se odstranijo; Flowise porabi `svc-ai-litellm` Namesto tega. Ni več podvojene uporabe LiteLLM. Pretok ostane zelen po refaktorju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Flowise** is a visual builder for AI workflows. Create, test, and publish chains that combine LLMs, your documents, tools, and vector search, without writing glue code."
msgstr "**Pretok** je vizualni graditelj za AI delovnih tokov. Ustvarjajte, preizkušajte in objavljajte verige, ki združujejo LLM, vaše dokumente, orodja in iskanje vektorjev, brez pisanja lepilne kode."

msgid "**Folder View**: ``vars/menu_categories.yml`` holds a nested folder tree; an application appears in every folder whose ``tags`` share one of its galaxy tags, and in the ``fallback`` folder when no other folder takes it. The view opens at the top level and keeps the open folder in ``?folder=`` and the search in ``?q=``. Switch it off per inventory with ``services.dashboard.folders: false``."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Folder View**: `vars/menu_categories.yml` holds a nested folder tree; an application appears in every folder whose `tags` share one of its galaxy tags, and in the `fallback` folder when no other folder takes it. The view opens at the top level and keeps the open folder in `?folder=` and the search in `?q=`. Switch it off per inventory with `services.dashboard.folders: false`."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Folder navigation:** The sidebar mirrors the repository tree and highlights the current page and heading."
msgstr "**Navigacija mape:** Stranska vrstica zrcali drevo skladišča in poudarja trenutno stran in smer."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Follow hashtags, accounts, or trends** across multiple Mastodon-compatible servers."
msgstr "**Spremljajte oznake, račune ali trende** več Mastodon-združljivi strežniki."

msgid "**Follows the host:** The MCP server is registered with each agent the workstation actually deploys."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**For Developers**"
msgstr "**Za razvijalce**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**For Users**"
msgstr "**Za uporabnike**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**For searching file contents, use the Grep tool.** If shelling out is unavoidable, use a single `grep` invocation with multiple file arguments (e.g. `grep -nE 'pattern' file1 file2 file3`) or a recursive call with a path/glob (e.g. `grep -rnE 'pattern' path/`)."
msgstr "**Za iskanje vsebine datotek uporabite orodje Grep.** Če je obstreljevanje neizogibno, uporabite eno `grep` oviranje več argumentov v datotekah (Npr. `grep -nE 'pattern' file1 file2 file3`) ali rekurzivni klic s stezo/globom (Npr. `grep -rnE 'pattern' path/`)."

msgid "**Force Execution Mode:** When `CLEANUP=true`, cleanup is executed immediately."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Force Execution Mode:** When ``CLEANUP=true``, cleanup is executed immediately."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Foreign deploy source.** The deploy template deploys from an inventory repository bound as a Semaphore repository. Private repositories are supported and are the default; the repository URL and its deploy key are mandatory inventory values with no default. The Semaphore test variant includes `web-app-gitea`, which hosts a private inventory repository for the `target` service."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fork identity** for the operator's CI-redeploy shortcuts: `INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT` (defaults to the local OS username) and `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_URL` (composed as `https://github.com/$INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT/$INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`), both set by handlers under `utils/env/handlers/infinito/` (`fork_account.py`, `fork_repository_url.py`). The fork repository name itself lives in `default.env` as `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`."
msgstr "**Identiteta vilic** za bližnjice CI-redeploy upravljavca: `INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT` (privzeto krajevno uporabniško ime OS) ter `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_URL` (sestavljena kot `https://github.com/$INFINITO_FORK_ACCOUNT/$INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`), ki jih določijo obdelovalci `utils/env/handlers/infinito/` (`fork_account.py`, `fork_repository_url.py`). Ime skladišča sam živi v `default.env` kot `INFINITO_FORK_REPOSITORY_NAME`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Foundation for Further Stacks:** Ideal starting point for Flask, Django, scientific computing, and automation."
msgstr "**Temelj za nadaljnje sklada:** Idealno izhodišče za Flask, Django, znanstveno računalništvo, in avtomatizacijo."

msgid "**Four eyes:** when ``services.access-request.four_eyes`` is ``true``, a grant needs two different approvers. It grants only the roles both kept selected."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Four eyes:** when `services.access-request.four_eyes` is `true`, a grant needs two different approvers. It grants only the roles both kept selected."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Frame.** The header box and the footer box get side borders. The header box rounds its bottom corners and the footer box its top corners. Each corner's radius is `min(R, distance from the box edge to the nearest card under that corner)`, so a card that reaches the edge meets a square corner and closes flush, and the radius grows back in the gap between card rows. `R` comes from the corporate design's large radius."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Front proxy and group gate:** The UI is reached only through the front proxy on port 443, behind an OAuth2 proxy that admits only members of this role's administrator group. The SSO flags turn on as soon as any inventory host runs `web-app-keycloak`, and the deploy refuses to run while they resolve to false."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Front proxy and group gate:** The UI is reached only through the front proxy on port 443, behind an OAuth2 proxy that admits only members of this role’s administrator group. The SSO flags turn on as soon as any inventory host runs ``web-app-keycloak``, and the deploy refuses to run while they resolve to false."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Front proxy is triggered by OpenResty.** An application gets a vhost exactly when its own `meta/services.yml` enables and shares `openresty`. Today no application declares that key (only `svc-prx-openresty` does), so every role that needs a vhost gets the new key."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Front-proxy integration:** Publish the app through ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` for TLS termination and per-domain routing."
msgstr "**Integracija sprednjega dela:** Objavi aplikacijo ``sys-stk-front-proxy`` za prekinitev TLS in usmerjanje na dom."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Front-proxy integration:** Publish the app through `sys-stk-front-proxy` for TLS termination and per-domain routing."
msgstr "**Integracija sprednjega dela:** Objavi aplikacijo `sys-stk-front-proxy` za prekinitev TLS in usmerjanje na dom."

msgid "**Frontend and backend.** Every role is styled and tested on its frontend and, where the app has one, on its separate backend (admin surface such as `wp-admin`, the Shopware or Magento admin, the Joomla administrator). A role with a backend shows backend views in its gallery in addition to the frontend views, and its Playwright spec covers both surfaces."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full Unicode support**: `utf8mb4` is the only MySQL/MariaDB character set that fully implements 4‑byte UTF‑8, allowing storage of emojis, supplementary symbols, and all global scripts without data loss."
msgstr "**Polna podpora Unicode**: `utf8mb4` je edini MySQL/MariaDB nabor znakov, ki se v celoti izvaja 4-bajt UTF-8, omogoča shranjevanje emojis, dodatne simbole, in vse globalne skripte brez izgube podatkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full extraction set:** the `-full` image ships the OCR and language detection dependencies, so scanned documents are extracted too."
msgstr "**Polni komplet za ekstrakcijo:** o `-full` slikovne ladje OCR in odvisnosti zaznavanja jezikov, tako skenirani dokumenti so pridobljeni tudi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full extraction set:** the ``-full`` image ships the OCR and language detection dependencies, so scanned documents are extracted too."
msgstr "**Polni komplet za ekstrakcijo:** o ``-full`` slikovne ladje OCR in odvisnosti zaznavanja jezikov, tako skenirani dokumenti so pridobljeni tudi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Full onion node**: `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` = node `.onion`; entire stack shifts together. No web/identity split, no domain-transform lookup."
msgstr "**Polno čebulno vozlišče**: `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` = vozlišče `.onion`; Celoten kup menjav skupaj. Ni razčlenitve spleta/identičnosti, ni vpogleda v transformacijo domene."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Automated Setup:** The role handles all tasks, including pulling the source repository, building the Docker image, and serving the presentation through a web server."
msgstr "**Popolnoma avtomatizirana nastavitev:** Vloga obravnava vse naloge, vključno z vlečenjem izvornega skladišča, gradnjo Dockerjeve slike in služijo predstavitvi prek spletnega strežnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized Deployment:** Simplifies installation using Docker Compose for the Nextcloud application and its MariaDB backend."
msgstr "**Popolnoma Dockerizirana uvedba:** Poenostavi namestitev z uporabo Docker Compose za Nextcloud uporaba in njena uporaba MariaDB Hrbtenica."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (``confluence_data``) and a slim overlay image for future add-ons."
msgstr "**Popolnoma Dockerized:** Sestavite skladalnik z namensko količino podatkov (``confluence_data``) in vitka slika za prihodnje dodatke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (``jira_data``) and a minimal overlay image to enable future plugins/config."
msgstr "**Popolnoma Dockerized:** Sestavite skladalnik z namensko količino podatkov (``jira_data``) in minimalno prekrivno sliko, da se omogoči prihodnje plugins/config."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (`confluence_data`) and a slim overlay image for future add-ons."
msgstr "**Popolnoma Dockerized:** Sestavite skladalnik z namensko količino podatkov (`confluence_data`) in vitka slika za prihodnje dodatke."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Fully Dockerized:** Compose stack with a dedicated data volume (`jira_data`) and a minimal overlay image to enable future plugins/config."
msgstr "**Popolnoma Dockerized:** Sestavite skladalnik z namensko količino podatkov (`jira_data`) in minimalno prekrivno sliko, da se omogoči prihodnje plugins/config."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Future‑proof:** Modern applications and standards have converged on UTF‑8; using `utf8mb4` avoids migration challenges later."
msgstr "**Odpornost na prihodnost:** Sodobne aplikacije in standardi so se približali UTF-8; uporaba `utf8mb4` se kasneje izogne migracijskim izzivom."

msgid "**GPU**: a container reaches the card only with `NVIDIA_VISIBLE_DEVICES` set, since `runtime: nvidia` alone injects nothing. Compose only; swarm has no GPU path."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Game Visibility:** Matches and moves can appear in social timelines."
msgstr "**Vidljivost igre:** Vžigalice in poteze se lahko pojavijo v družbenih časovnicah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gantt Charts & Timelines:** Visualize project schedules and dependencies using intuitive Gantt charts and timeline views, enabling effective planning and resource allocation."
msgstr "**Grafi in časovnice Gantt:** Predočite urnike in odvisnosti projektov z uporabo intuitivnih Ganttovih kart in časovnih pogledov, kar omogoča učinkovito načrtovanje in dodeljevanje virov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway backend:** The LiteLLM Gateway publishes those aliases, which are the names Ollama serves too, so the same model name routes to whichever local backend a deployment runs."
msgstr "**Hrbtenica prehoda:** – LiteLLM Gateway objavlja te vzdevke, ki so imena Ollama služi tudi, tako da isti model ime poti za katero koli lokalno backend uvajanje teče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway credentials:** Without Keycloak, access is gated by the LiteLLM UI username and password that the LiteLLM Gateway provisions. That pair keeps working alongside SSO as a break-glass login."
msgstr "**Kariera prehoda:** brez Keycloak, dostop je vrata z LiteLLM UI uporabniško ime in geslo, da LiteLLM Gateway določbe. Ta par še vedno dela poleg SSO kot prijavo lomnega stekla."

msgid "**Gateway token:** Without single sign-on, a generated gateway token guards the Control UI and the API. With single sign-on, the same secret is the gateway password (`OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD`) for the CLI inside the container, which reaches the gateway over loopback. The Control UI accepts its domain in every network the gateway is served on, such as the clearnet domain and its onion sibling, as its allowed origins."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Gateway token:** Without single sign-on, a generated gateway token guards the Control UI and the API. With single sign-on, the same secret is the gateway password (``OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_PASSWORD``) for the CLI inside the container, which reaches the gateway over loopback. The Control UI accepts its domain in every network the gateway is served on, such as the clearnet domain and its onion sibling, as its allowed origins."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Gateway-backed:** `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL` (the gateway root, since the agent appends `/v1/messages` itself) and `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` point the agent at the platform gateway."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Gateway-backed:** ``ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL`` (the gateway root, since the agent appends ``/v1/messages`` itself) and ``ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`` point the agent at the platform gateway."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway-backed:** one provider entry, no vendor credentials on the machine."
msgstr "**Vrata s hrbtom:** En vpis ponudnika, brez poverilnic na napravi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway-routed models:** With the LiteLLM Gateway deployed, the agent's model base URL points at that gateway and authenticates with a per-consumer virtual key."
msgstr "**Modeli, usmerjeni v prehod:** Z LiteLLM Gateway aktivirane, izhodiščne točke modela agenta na tem portalu in avtentificira z virtualnim ključem na potrošnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Gateway-routed models:** With the LiteLLM Gateway deployed, the agent’s model base URL points at that gateway and authenticates with a per-consumer virtual key."
msgstr "**Modeli, usmerjeni v prehod:** Z LiteLLM Gateway razporejena baza podatkov o modelu agenta na tem portalu in overjena z virtualnim ključem na potrošnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**General logs**: ``journalctl -f -u NGINX``"
msgstr "**Splošni dnevniki**: ``journalctl -f -u NGINX``"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**General logs**: `journalctl -f -u NGINX`"
msgstr "**Splošni dnevniki**: `journalctl -f -u NGINX`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Generate dynamic lists:** Lookups are often used to build inventories, secrets, or host lists dynamically."
msgstr "**Ustvari dinamične sezname:** Ogledi se pogosto uporabljajo za dinamično gradnjo popisov, skrivnosti ali seznamov gostiteljev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Generate** redirect rules via the ``web-opt-rdr-domains`` role"
msgstr "**Ustvari** preusmeriti pravila prek ``web-opt-rdr-domains`` vloga"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Generate** redirect rules via the `web-opt-rdr-domains` role"
msgstr "**Ustvari** preusmeriti pravila prek `web-opt-rdr-domains` vloga"

msgid "**Generated credentials**: `meta/secrets.yml` as in [`web-app-openclaw`](../../roles/web-app-openclaw/meta/secrets.yml)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Generated credentials:** Every service account password and the manager cluster key come from [secrets.yml](./meta/secrets.yml)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Generated credentials:** Every service account password and the manager cluster key come from `secrets.yml <./meta/secrets.yml>`__."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Generated reference:** API pages via ``sphinx-apidoc``, one page per role from its ``meta/main.yml`` and README, and an index of every YAML file."
msgstr "**Sestavljena referenca:** API strani preko ``sphinx-apidoc``, eno stran na vlogo iz svoje ``meta/main.yml`` in README, in indeks vsake datoteke YAML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Generated reference:** API pages via `sphinx-apidoc`, one page per role from its `meta/main.yml` and README, and an index of every YAML file."
msgstr "**Sestavljena referenca:** API strani preko `sphinx-apidoc`, eno stran na vlogo iz svoje `meta/main.yml` in README, in indeks vsake datoteke YAML."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Git Installation:** Uses the Pacman package manager to install Git."
msgstr "**Namestitev Git:** Uporablja upravljalnik paketov Pacman za namestitev Git."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Git Integration:** Ensures that the application source code is up-to-date by pulling from the specified Git repository."
msgstr "**Integracija Git:** zagotavlja, da je izvorna koda programa posodobljena s potegom iz navedenega Git Skladišče."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Git over SSH:** gitlab-sshd on the public SSH port with role-generated host keys under `<instance>/config/hostkeys/`. Back up that directory: it is not part of any named volume, and a host rebuild or instance purge regenerates the keys, so every git client then sees a host-key-changed warning until it re-trusts the new key."
msgstr "**Postavite se nad SSH:** gitlab-sshd na javnem SSH vrata z vlogami, ki ustvarjajo gostiteljske ključe pod `<instance>/config/hostkeys/`. Nazaj gor, da imenik: to ni del katerega koli imenovanega glasnosti, in gostitelj obnovi ali primer čistke regenerira ključe, tako da vsak odjemalec Git nato vidi opozorilo gostitelj-ključ-sprememba, dokler ponovno zaupa nov ključ."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Git over SSH:** gitlab-sshd on the public SSH port with role-generated host keys under ``<instance>/config/hostkeys/``. Back up that directory: it is not part of any named volume, and a host rebuild or instance purge regenerates the keys, so every git client then sees a host-key-changed warning until it re-trusts the new key."
msgstr "**Postavite se nad SSH:** gitlab-sshd na javnem SSH vrata z vlogami, ki ustvarjajo gostiteljske ključe pod ``<instance>/config/hostkeys/``. Nazaj gor, da imenik: to ni del katerega koli imenovanega glasnosti, in gostitelj obnovi ali primer čistke regenerira ključe, tako da vsak odjemalec Git nato vidi opozorilo gostitelj-ključ-sprememba, dokler ponovno zaupa nov ključ."

msgid "**GitLab migrations no longer run out of locks.** GitLab's database migration failed on PostgreSQL 18 with \"out of shared memory\". The shared and the per-application PostgreSQL now allow 256 locks per transaction."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Gitea OpenID 2.0.** `[openid] ENABLE_OPENID_SIGNIN` and `ENABLE_OPENID_SIGNUP` enable OpenID 2.0, not the OIDC source, and follow `login.method.openid2.enabled`."
