msgid "**Grants** -- ``commercial_use``, ``modifications``, ``distribution``, ``private_use``, ``patent_use``, ``self_host``. True when the licence allows it. ``self_host`` is the question this repository actually asks and the one field the upstream taxonomy has no column for."
