msgid "**HTTP clients are rate-limited and banned by their own address.** The vhost sets ``proxy_forwarded_client_address``, so OpenResty sends ``Forwarded: for=$remote_addr`` on every location and replaces any client-supplied value, and Stalwart reads it (``STALWART_HTTP_SETTINGS``: ``clientIpSource: forwarded`` with one trusted hop, ``forwardedHops: 1``)."
msgstr ""

msgid "**HTTP clients are rate-limited and banned by their own address.** The vhost sets `proxy_forwarded_client_address`, so OpenResty sends `Forwarded: for=$remote_addr` on every location and replaces any client-supplied value, and Stalwart reads it (`STALWART_HTTP_SETTINGS`: `clientIpSource: forwarded` with one trusted hop, `forwardedHops: 1`)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP on the onion side** (TLS forced off for `.onion`), vhosts on `:80`, upstream gets `X-Forwarded-Proto: https`."
msgstr "**HTTP na čebulni strani** (TLS prisiljena za `.onion`), vhosts on `:80`, toku gre `X-Forwarded-Proto: https`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**HTTP on the onion side:** TLS is forced off for `.onion` (no Let's Encrypt possible); onion v3 crypto is the transport auth."
msgstr "**HTTP na čebulni strani:** TLS je prisiljen za `.onion` (Ne Šifrirajmo mogoče); čebula v3 Kripto je transportna oprema."

