msgid "**LDAP vCards:** With LDAP enabled, `mod_vcard` reads every vCard from the directory: `FN`, `GIVEN`, `FAMILY`, `EMAIL`, `NICKNAME`, `TEL` and `PHOTO` come from the matching `LDAP.USER.ATTRIBUTES`. Users cannot edit them in their client."
