msgid "**LDAP variant:** Configure and enable Joomla's core `plg_authentication_ldap` against `svc-db-openldap` whenever the `ldap` login method is on (the `ldap` service without `sso`, variant 1), binding with the directory administrator, searching users by their login attribute and reading full name and email from the directory; new directory users are created in `Registered`."
