msgid "**Local administrator:** While the `native` method is on (by default when neither Keycloak nor `svc-db-openldap` is deployed), the `userpass` auth method carries one account, the platform administrator bound to the `administrator` policy. The role marks the mount it enables with the description `infinito-nexus-managed`. A deploy with the method off disables a mount that carries this mark; a `userpass` mount without it is left untouched."
