# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, the backend command (in `templates/compose.yml.j2`) imports the internal CA into a writable `cacerts` copy and points the JVM at it via `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. The shared `with-ca-trust.sh` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot's server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with `PKIX path building failed`. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework's CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**Sklad OIDC JVM CA (samo s podpisom TLS):** ko `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, ukaz backend (v `templates/compose.yml.j2`) uvoz notranjega CA v zapisljivo `cacerts` Kopiranje in kaže JVM na to preko `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. Delimo `with-ca-trust.sh` vstopna točka zajema OS/NSS/env zaupanja trgovinah, vendar ne JVM Truststore, tako brez tega PenpotKlici na OIDC na strežniku Keycloak neuspešno z `PKIX path building failed`. Preglasitev je za samopodpisanim načinom (je neoperacija v proizvodnji, kjer so že zaupani pravi certi, podpisani s CA) Pot CA je zakodirana, ker CA-uveride ponovno serializira ukaz."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, the backend command (in ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) imports the internal CA into a writable ``cacerts`` copy and points the JVM at it via ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. The shared ``with-ca-trust.sh`` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot’s server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with ``PKIX path building failed``. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework’s CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**Sklad OIDC JVM CA (samo s podpisom TLS):** ko ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, ukaz backend (v ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) uvoz notranjega CA v zapisljivo ``cacerts`` Kopiranje in kaže JVM na to preko ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. Delimo ``with-ca-trust.sh`` vstopna točka zajema OS/NSS/env zaupanja trgovinah, vendar ne JVM Truststore, tako brez tega PenpotKlici OIDC na strežniku/userinfo Keycloak neuspešno z ``PKIX path building failed``. Preglasitev je za samopodpisanim načinom (je neoperacija v proizvodnji, kjer so že zaupani pravi certi, podpisani s CA) in pot CA je zakodirana, ker CA-uveride okvir ponovno serializira ukaz."

