msgstr ""

msgid "**Onion-capable:** Unlike the storage engine, the console is a browser surface and is served over the node onion when Tor is enabled."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Onion-only relay:** accepts a recipient only when its domain ends with `.onion`; every clearnet recipient is refused with `550`."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Onion-only relay:** accepts a recipient only when its domain ends with ``.onion``; every clearnet recipient is refused with ``550``."
