msgstr "**Odhodna pošta:** Pošta obvestila KIX poteka skozi projekt ``sys-svc-mail-smtp`` Rele."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Outbound network calls** are bounded by `sandbox.network.allowedDomains` (see [sandbox.md](sandbox.md))."
msgstr "**Oddaljeni omrežni klici** jih omejuje `sandbox.network.allowedDomains` (glej [sandbox.md](sandbox.md))."

msgid "**Outsider sign-out:** The hook expires the sessions and API tokens of every external account that belongs to none of the role groups. The break-glass account and the platform administrator are exempt."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Overall impact:** Day-to-day usage is more stable, commands behave as expected in more environments, and setup/deploy workflows require less troubleshooting."
msgstr "**Skupni učinek:** Dnevna uporaba je bolj stabilna, ukazi se obnašajo tako, kot se pričakuje v več okoljih, in nastavljanje/razgradnja delovnih tokov zahteva manj odpravljanje težav."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Override**: Rewrites logout URLs to point at your OIDC provider’s logout endpoint."
msgstr "**Povozi**: Prepiše odjavo URL-jev do točke na končni točki vašega OIDC ponudnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Overrides** supplied through the normal Ansible variable `applications` in inventory, group vars, host vars, or role vars."
msgstr "**Povozi** dobavljeno prek običajne spremenljivke Ansible `applications` v popisu, skupini var, gostiteljski var ali vlogi var."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Overrides** supplied through the normal Ansible variable `users` in inventory, group vars, host vars, or role vars."
msgstr "**Povozi** dobavljeno prek običajne spremenljivke Ansible `users` v popisu, skupini var, gostiteljski var ali vlogi var."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Own STUN/TURN:** When ``web-svc-coturn`` is part of the deployment, WebRTC uses it with time-limited HMAC credentials instead of a third-party STUN server."
msgstr "**Lastna STUN/TRG:** Kdaj ``web-svc-coturn`` je del uvajanja, WebRTC ga uporablja s časovno omejeno HMAC poverilnice namesto strežnika STUN tretje osebe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Own STUN/TURN:** When `web-svc-coturn` is part of the deployment, WebRTC uses it with time-limited HMAC credentials instead of a third-party STUN server."
msgstr "**Lastna STUN/TRG:** Kdaj `web-svc-coturn` je del uvajanja, WebRTC ga uporablja s časovno omejeno HMAC poverilnice namesto strežnika STUN tretje osebe."

msgid "**Own site**: only when `WORDPRESS_SITE_OWNER_ENABLED` is `true`. For a member of `/roles/web-app-wordpress/site-owner` the mapper finds the site `<login>.<host of WORDPRESS_SITE_OWNER_BASE_URL>`. It creates the site with the member as administrator when it is missing, recording the `sub` claim in the site meta `infinito_site_owner_subject`, restores it when it is archived and keeps the member its administrator. For a user outside the group it archives that site, keeping its content. It only acts on a site whose recorded subject matches, or on a site that `infinito_rbac_reserve_own_site()` reserved for the login through `infinito_site_owner_login` at deploy. The first sign-in claims a reserved site: it records the subject and removes every other member, the deploy's interim administrator included. The per-site loop skips the own site. A login the member label rule refuses, a login claim other than the account's login, a missing subject or a foreign site is logged and skips only this step, so the sign-in still completes. At deploy, `infinito_rbac_archive_reserved_sites_of_former_members()` archives every own site whose login is no longer an inventory member and ends its owner's sessions."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Owned per role:** Each consumer declares one table under its own name, so rules are added and retired with the role that needs them."
msgstr "**V lasti posamezne vloge:** Vsak potrošnik razglasi po eno mizo pod svojim imenom, zato se pravila dodajo in upokojijo z vlogo, ki jih potrebuje."

msgid "**Owner provisioned on every deploy:** Once the hub answers, the deploy runs ``files/python/provision.py`` inside the container with ``HA_OWNER_ONLY=1``. On a fresh hub the script creates the owner from the platform administrator’s username and ``credentials.administrator_password``, names the hub after the corporate design title when the design service is on, and closes the remaining onboarding steps. On every later deploy it signs in with the same credentials and reports no change. When the hub refuses them, the deploy writes the password into the hub’s auth store with Home Assistant’s ``auth`` script, restarts the hub and signs in again. Both calls receive their values on standard input."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Owner provisioned on every deploy:** Once the hub answers, the deploy runs `files/python/provision.py` inside the container with `HA_OWNER_ONLY=1`. On a fresh hub the script creates the owner from the platform administrator's username and `credentials.administrator_password`, names the hub after the corporate design title when the design service is on, and closes the remaining onboarding steps. On every later deploy it signs in with the same credentials and reports no change. When the hub refuses them, the deploy writes the password into the hub's auth store with Home Assistant's `auth` script, restarts the hub and signs in again. Both calls receive their values on standard input."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**PDS auto-provisioning:** Have the broker call ``com.atproto.server.createAccount`` on first login and cache the resulting handle and DID per Keycloak username."
msgstr "**Samodejno zagotavljanje PDS:** Naj mešetar pokliče. ``com.atproto.server.createAccount`` ob prvi prijavi in predpomnilniku nastali ročaj in DID na Keycloak uporabniško ime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**PDS auto-provisioning:** Have the broker call `com.atproto.server.createAccount` on first login and cache the resulting handle and DID per Keycloak username."
msgstr "**Samodejno zagotavljanje PDS:** Naj mešetar pokliče. `com.atproto.server.createAccount` ob prvi prijavi in predpomnilniku nastali ročaj in DID na Keycloak uporabniško ime."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**PDS unreachable:** the broker bubbles up the createAccount or createSession failure and the user sees an HTML error page on the handoff route. Re-trying the visit after PDS recovery completes the handoff."
msgstr "**PDS nedostopen:** posrednik mehurčke navzgor ustvariteRačun ali ustvarite napakoSession in uporabnik vidi stran HTML napake na poti predaje. Ponovni poskus obiska po okrevanju PDS konča predajo."

msgid "**PHP ini hardening:** ``expose_php`` off; ``session.upload_progress.enabled = 0`` and, on PHP 8.5 only, ``fatal_error_backtraces = 0`` against CVE-2026-109619."
msgstr ""

msgid "**PHP ini hardening:** `expose_php` off; `session.upload_progress.enabled = 0` and, on PHP 8.5 only, `fatal_error_backtraces = 0` against CVE-2026-109619."
msgstr ""

msgid "**PHP-FPM worker recycling:** ``pm.max_requests`` from ``PHP_FPM_MAX_REQUESTS`` for images whose ``[www]`` pool reads ``php-fpm.d/*.conf``."
msgstr ""

msgid "**PHP-FPM worker recycling:** `pm.max_requests` from `PHP_FPM_MAX_REQUESTS` for images whose `[www]` pool reads `php-fpm.d/*.conf`."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**PKI engine ships behind a flag, default off.** When on, the play mounts `pki`, generates an internal root CA and one issuing role."
msgstr "**PKI motorne ladje za zastavo, privzeto izključene.** Ko se igra začne, se igra dvigne. `pki`, ustvarja notranje korenine CA in eno vlogo izdaje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Package installation** of `NGINX` and `NGINX-mod-stream`."
msgstr "**Namestitev paketa** o `NGINX` ter `NGINX-mod-stream`."

