msgid "**Private repositories:** Semaphore clones the repository over its SSH URL with `repository.key`, which the deploy stores as an SSH key of the project, so a private repository is the default case: register the public half of `repository.key` as a read-only deploy key of the repository. The repository holds the inventory the way `infinito administration inventory provision` writes it, with `devices.yml` at its root, and `vault_password` is the password its vault values are encrypted with."
msgstr ""

