msgid "**Redacted Log Excerpts:** The 200-line excerpt of a failed container passes through ``files/python/redact.py`` with the ``LOG_REDACTION_RULES`` of `22_logging.yml <../../group_vars/all/22_logging.yml>`__, the same rules the log collector and the Loki ingest gateway apply."
