msgid "**Same contract.** `POST /v1/systemone` as the gateway speaks it, plus the `GET /health` the backend already serves."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Same contract.** ``POST /v1/systemone`` as the gateway speaks it, plus the ``GET /health`` the backend already serves."
