msgid "**Seeded instance findings:** A third-party web font from ``fonts.googleapis.com`` in ``files/app/html/index.html``, a session cookie set before consent and a missing ``X-Content-Type-Options`` header in ``files/app/config/nginx.conf``."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Seeded instance findings:** A third-party web font from `fonts.googleapis.com` in `files/app/html/index.html`, a session cookie set before consent and a missing `X-Content-Type-Options` header in `files/app/config/nginx.conf`."
