msgid "**Seeded legal findings:** An AGPL-3.0 runtime dependency, an Apache-2.0 dependency without its NOTICE, a build-only GPL-3.0 dependency, a vendored script without a licence (``files/app/html/static/thirdparty/confetti.js``), and a third-party brand logo used as the site’s own branding (``files/app/html/static/thirdparty/northwind-logo.svg``)."
