msgstr ""

msgid "**Seeded login throttle:** A ``limit_req`` throttle in front of ``/login``, paired with the weak test credential and lockout policy in ``files/app/fixtures/seeded-credentials.yml``, so credential brute forcing stays bounded."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Seeded login throttle:** A `limit_req` throttle in front of `/login`, paired with the weak test credential and lockout policy in `files/app/fixtures/seeded-credentials.yml`, so credential brute forcing stays bounded."
