msgid "**Seeded static weaknesses:** A known-vulnerable dependency (``lodash`` 4.17.11) in ``files/app/package.json``, and a weak TLS profile in ``files/app/config/tls-profile.conf``."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Seeded static weaknesses:** A known-vulnerable dependency (`lodash` 4.17.11) in `files/app/package.json`, and a weak TLS profile in `files/app/config/tls-profile.conf`."
