msgstr "**Poddomene:** `sub.<addr>.onion` poti do **enako** skrita storitev; stranka pošlje polno `Host:` glava → vhost routing deluje točno tako kot Clearnet. ([Vrsta naslova](https://spec.torproject.org/address-spec), [RFC 7686 §2](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7686.html))"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sudo Configuration:** Grants passwordless sudo rights for rsync, enabling secure and automated backup transfers."
msgstr "**Nastavitve Sudo:** Podaja pravice brez gesla za rsync, omogoča varne in avtomatizirane varnostne prenose."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sudo Package Installation:** Installs the [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) package if it is not already present."
msgstr "**Namestitev paketa Sudo:** Namesti [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) paket, če še ni prisoten."

# translated-by: libretranslate
