msgstr "**Namestitev paketa Sudo:** Namesti `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ paket, če še ni prisoten."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sudo Privileges:** Deploys a dedicated sudoers configuration to grant the administrator user [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) rights with password prompt."
msgstr "**Sudo Privilegiji:** Razpiše namensko nastavitev sudoers za dodelitev administrator uporabnika [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) pravice z geslom takoj."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sudo Privileges:** Deploys a dedicated sudoers configuration to grant the administrator user `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ rights with password prompt."
msgstr "**Sudo Privilegiji:** Razpiše namensko nastavitev sudoers za dodelitev administrator uporabnika `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ pravice z geslom takoj."

