msgstr ""

msgid "**Version Upgrades:** When the image ships another Shopware than the version recorded in ``deployment.version``, the init container runs ``system:update:finish`` and the plugin updates once, then records the new version."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Version Upgrades:** When the image ships another Shopware than the version recorded in `deployment.version`, the init container runs `system:update:finish` and the plugin updates once, then records the new version."
