msgid "**Version Upgrades:** When the pinned image ships a newer Matomo than the data volume holds, the deploy installs that release into the volume, keeps ``config/config.ini.php``, ``misc/user/`` and Marketplace plugins, and runs ``core:update``; a volume newer than the image stops the deploy."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Version Upgrades:** When the pinned image ships a newer Matomo than the data volume holds, the deploy installs that release into the volume, keeps `config/config.ini.php`, `misc/user/` and Marketplace plugins, and runs `core:update`; a volume newer than the image stops the deploy."
