msgid "**Webhook intake:** A webhook is accepted only with a valid signature (`X-Hub-Signature-256` for GitHub and Gitea, the OpenProject and Zammad equivalents); a repeated delivery id is dropped; the event is re-fetched by id from the provider's API and acted on from the fetched data, never from the webhook body. The signature check and the deduplication are the committed `utils.orchestrator.webhook` library."
