msgid "A cold server answers its opening requests well above its steady rate, and the pair measured first used to inherit that and win every sweep. Repeating a pair back to back does not help, because all of its runs then sit inside the same opening window. The grid is therefore walked once per pass and the passes are what repeat, so the bonus lands on one run of one pair and the median drops it. The recorded spread says whether the winner is a real difference or the noise the whole grid sits in."
msgstr "Hladen strežnik odgovarja na svoje zahteve za odpiranje, ki so precej nad njegovo enakomerno hitrostjo, in par, ki so ga najprej izmerili, je to podedoval in zmagal pri vsakem iskanju. Ponavljanje para nazaj na hrbet ne pomaga, saj vse njegove poti nato sedijo v istem odprtem oknu. Mreža se torej sprehaja enkrat na prehod in prepustnice so tisto, kar se ponavlja, zato bonus pristane na enem teku enega para in mediana ga spusti. V posnetku piše, ali je zmagovalec prava razlika ali hrup, v katerem sedi celotna mreža."

