msgid "A failed ``final`` swaps nothing: Stalwart 0.16 serves the database ``stalwart`` again, and ``stalwart_v1`` and ``migrate-v016/state`` hold the unfinished copy. ``stalwart-migrate rollback`` does not apply, it copies a 1.x store back into a new 0.16 store. Every deploy of this role runs ``all`` again while the store is 0.16, so keep the role out of deploys until the rows are understood."
msgstr ""

msgid "A failed `final` swaps nothing: Stalwart 0.16 serves the database `stalwart` again, and `stalwart_v1` and `migrate-v016/state` hold the unfinished copy. `stalwart-migrate rollback` does not apply, it copies a 1.x store back into a new 0.16 store. Every deploy of this role runs `all` again while the store is 0.16, so keep the role out of deploys until the rows are understood."
msgstr ""

