msgstr ""

msgid "A failed mutation leaves the repository `rev` unstored, so the next cycle plans the repository again. Mappings already written stay, so nothing is created twice. A mirrored event deleted by hand in Mobilizon is recreated on the next update of its record and forgotten on the next delete."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A failing pre-state snapshot aborts the deploy (no `suppress_flush`): no update proceeds without a successful backup of the state it is about to change. `svc-bkp-local-2-device` is never started at deploy time (no device present); it stays plug-triggered via its `.mount` unit."
msgstr "Neuspešen preddržavni posnetek prekine uporabo (ni `suppress_flush`): ni posodobitev prihodkov brez uspešne varnostne kopije države, ki se bo spremenila. `svc-bkp-local-2-device` se nikoli ne začne z razporeditvijo (naprava ni prisotna); ostane plug-triggered preko svojega `.mount` Enota."

msgid "A failure classified as deterministic is not retried; a flaky one is retried once."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fallback MUST stay inside the permitted set, and a run whose whole permitted set is unservable MUST fail rather than leave it. The job title and the artifact name carry the kind the matrix assigned; the step summary carries the effective one."
msgstr "Rezerva mora ostati znotraj dovoljenega nabora in teči, katerega celoten dovoljeni niz je neuslužen, mora spodleteti, ne pa ga pustiti. Naslov dela in ime artefakta nosita vrsto, ki ji je bila dodeljena matrika; povzetek koraka nosi efektivno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A fallback is reported, never silent. The job title and artifact name carry the kind the matrix *assigned*, while [docker_dataroot.sh](../../scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/docker_dataroot.sh) writes the *effective* filesystem and the reason into the step summary. When a run has to prove a filesystem-dependent path, read the summary rather than the title, or name the kind on the run to make it a demand. The snapshot mode of `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is the case that matters: it only engages on btrfs and zfs."
msgstr "Poročajo o umiku. Naslov dela in ime artefakta nosita takšno matrico. *dodeljena*, medtem ko [docker_dataroot.sh](../../scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/docker_dataroot.sh) piše *učinkovito* datotečni sistem in razlog za povzetek korakov. Ko mora teči dokazati datotečni sistem-odvisna pot, preberite povzetek namesto naslova, ali ime vrste na begu, da bi bilo povpraševanje. Način posnetka `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` je pomembno: sodeluje samo na btrfs in zfs."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A federated and community-driven platform for discussion, media sharing, and social networking."
msgstr "Platforma za razpravo, izmenjavo medijev in družbeno mreženje, ki jo vodi skupnost."

msgid "A field overwritten by a timer or a deploy counts as overwritten, the same as one overwritten at login."
msgstr ""

msgid "A file is either a role's own (it changes that role), a test (it runs in T0), a plugin (it changes whoever calls it by name), a group_vars file (it changes whoever reads one of its keys), a module others import, deploy machinery or a global deploy file (it changes every deploy), CI or developer tooling no deploy runs, or unknown. The tooling list is closed on purpose: a script directory nobody listed counts as deploy machinery, so a new one widens the plan instead of silently narrowing it. ``agents/`` is not tooling: the agent roles read its YAML through the ``agent_config`` lookup at deploy time."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A filesystem row states the kind the matrix *assigned*. A deploy may fall back from it when the host kernel cannot serve it (``scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh``) and the title does not record that, so read that axis as a preference ranking and prove the kind separately before pinning it."
msgstr "Datotečna vrstica navaja vrsto matrike *dodeljena*. Postavitev lahko pade nazaj iz nje, ko gostitelj jedro ne more služiti (``scripts/tests/deploy/utils/filesystem/resolve.sh``) in naslov ne beleži, da, tako preberite, da os kot prednostno razvrstitev in dokazati vrsto ločeno, preden ga pining."

msgid "A filter file registers the keys of the literal dict its ``FilterModule.filters`` returns; a lookup or action file registers its stem when it defines the plugin class; a module registers its stem. A file without the plugin class is a helper and registers nothing."
