# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "A handler MAY import stdlib, [parser.py](../parser.py), [runtime.py](../runtime.py), and any repo module whose own import closure is stdlib-only. The whole closure MUST import and run on the bare bootstrap python, before any dependency is installed. `utils.cache.files` and [yaml_bootstrap.py](../../yaml_bootstrap.py) qualify; `utils.cache.yaml` does not, because it imports PyYAML. Read SPOT files with `utils.cache.files.read_text` plus `utils.yaml_bootstrap.load_block` or a stdlib line parse. `load_block` accepts block mappings, block lists and string scalars only, and raises `BootstrapYamlError` on everything else, so a SPOT file read this way MUST stay inside that subset. [test_bare_bootstrap.py](../../../tests/integration/meta/env/test_bare_bootstrap.py) enforces this by running the generator with every non-stdlib import blocked."
msgstr "Nadzornik lahko uvaža stdlib, [parser.py](../parser.py), [runtime.py](../runtime.py), in vsak repo modul, katerega lastno uvoz zaprtje je stdlib-samo. Celotno zaprtje MORA uvažati in teči na golih škornjih papagaj, preden se namesti kakršna koli odvisnost. `utils.cache.files` ter [yaml_bootstrap.py](../../yaml_bootstrap.py) izpolnjujejo pogoje; `utils.cache.yaml` ne, ker uvaža PyYAML. Preberite datoteke SPOT z `utils.cache.files.read_text` plus `utils.yaml_bootstrap.load_block` ali strdlib linijo razčleniti. `load_block` sprejema kartiranje blokov, sezname blokov in samo nizov skalarjev, in dvigne `BootstrapYamlError` na vse ostalo, tako da SPOT datoteko prebral na ta način MORA ostati v tej podvrsti. [test_bare_bootstrap.py](../../../tests/integration/meta/env/test_bare_bootstrap.py) uveljavlja to z zagonom generatorja z vsakim ne-stdlib uvoz blokira."

