msgid "A lightweight, Docker-powered UI framework that offers Infinito.Nexus users a unified interface to access all their applications in one intuitive dashboard. 🚀"
msgstr "Lahek okvir IU na Docker pogon, ki ponuja Infinito.Nexus uporabniki enotnega vmesnika za dostop do vseh svojih aplikacij v eni intuitivni armaturni plošči. 🚀"

msgid "A line counts when it is an added line (``+`` but not the ``+++`` header), carries a comment, and that comment is neither a shebang nor a nocheck/noqa directive nor a parameter doc."
