msgid "A location not starting with ``/`` is a remote ``[user@]host:/path``."
msgstr "Lokacija, ki se ne začne z ``/`` je daljinec ``[user@]host:/path``."

msgid "A locked field shows a translated sentence that it is managed by the deployment, together with its inventory path. The settings page additionally shows one banner listing every managed field of that page."
