msgid "A locked field uses the application's own lock where one exists (a value set through env or a config file that the application itself renders read-only); otherwise the shared renderer (`roles/sys-front-inj-javascript/templates/profile_lock.js.j2`, generalized from profile fields to every managed field) renders it read-only."
