msgid "A row deploys its node in one network mode, handed to the inventory as `NETWORK_MODE`. The modes a row can take follow its role ([network_modes.md](../../docs/contributing/design/network_modes.md)): a variant that pins `services.tor.enabled` false only takes `clearnet`; a role without a `tor` bond takes `clearnet`, plus `multi` when the `services` closure of its discovery row names the Tor provider, where the node runs Tor and the role stays on clearnet; `reachability.modes` drops every mode that needs a network the role excludes; `reachability.single_mode` drops `multi`; the Tor provider never takes `clearnet`. The `network` input decides what the axis is allowed to do at all:"
