# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "BookWyrm provides a federated social network for books built on ActivityPub. Each instance can be private, invitation-only, or open for public registration. Users can import/export book lists, interact with others across the Fediverse, and maintain their own curated reading environment. As an admin, you can configure moderation tools, content rules, and federation policies to suit your community."
msgstr "BookWyrm zagotavlja federirano socialno omrežje za knjige, zgrajene na ActivityPub. Vsak primer je lahko privaten, povabljen ali odprt za javno registracijo. Uporabniki lahko uvažajo/izvažajo sezname knjig, komunicirajo z drugimi po vsej Fediverse in vzdržujejo lastno kurirano bralno okolje. Kot admin lahko nastavite orodja za zmernost, pravila vsebine in politike federacije, ki ustrezajo vaši skupnosti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Bookkeeping only: the compose layering below keys off the concrete resources a worktree was handed, never off this number, so a stray slot cannot make compose demand a value nobody set."
msgstr "Samo knjigovodstvo: komponiranje plasti pod ključi od betonskih virov Worktree je bila podana, nikoli off to številko, tako da zablodela reža ne more narediti compose zahteva vrednost nihče nastavljen."

msgid "Bookmarks and sessions are not persisted: the role mounts no volume for `/app/.data` (upstream `src/util.js` keeps the SQLite files there, the role has no `meta/volumes.yml`), so every container recreate wipes all bookmarks and signs the owner out, while the README says the role persists its SQLite data. Options: declare a volume mounted at `/app/.data`, or correct the README."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Boost your development journey with Gitea, a lightweight and energetic self-hosted Git service that offers efficient code collaboration, intuitive version control, and an agile environment for your projects. Ignite your coding spirit, innovate faster, and code with confidence!"
msgstr "Povečajte svojo razvojno pot z Gitea, lahek in energičen samogostitelj Git storitev, ki ponuja učinkovito sodelovanje kode, intuitiven nadzor različic in agilno okolje za vaše projekte. Vžgite svoj kodni duh, inovirajte hitreje in kodo z zaupanjem!"

