# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both on the position"
msgstr "Oba na položaju"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both paths elevate privileges via `sudo` when not run as root, and the script verifies `bwrap` and `socat` on `PATH` before it exits. macOS uses `sandbox-exec` from the base system and does not need this target."
msgstr "Obe poti dvigujeta privilegije preko `sudo` ko ne teče kot root, in scenarij preveri `bwrap` ter `socat` o `PATH` Preden odide. uporaba macOS `sandbox-exec` iz osnovnega sistema in ne potrebuje tega cilja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both platforms run model-generated code, which is untrusted, so a kernel-level boundary is required on top of their in-app sandboxing. [gVisor](https://gvisor.dev/) provides that boundary behind an OCI runtime, so each agent app stays a normal container spec and only pins `runtime: runsc`, reusing the existing image pipeline, replicas, healthchecks, and dual-mode machinery. [Kata Containers](https://katacontainers.io/) wrapping Firecracker was the original choice; Decision #2 records why it is unreachable on this container engine. ([E2B](https://github.com/e2b-dev/infra) is the higher-level alternative but brings its own Nomad/Consul orchestration and x86-cloud self-host, which would replace the swarm model.)"
msgstr "Obe platformi poganjata modelno ustvarjeno kodo, ki je nezaupana, zato je na vrhu njunega notranjega peskovnika potrebna meja ravni jedra. [gVisor](https://gvisor.dev/) določa, da je meja za čas delovanja OCI, tako da vsak agent aplikacija ostane običajno zabojnik spec in samo zatiči `runtime: runsc`, ponovna uporaba obstoječega slikovnega cevovoda, replik, zdravstvenih pregledov in dvofaznih strojev. [Zabojniki Kata](https://katacontainers.io/) Zavijanje Firecracker je bila prvotna izbira; Odločitev #2 beleži, zakaj ga ni mogoče doseči na tem kontejnerskem motorju. ([E2B](https://github.com/e2b-dev/infra) je alternativa višje ravni, vendar prinaša svojo Nomad / Consul orkestracijo in x86-Cloud self-host, ki bi nadomestil model roja.)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both pools feed the assignment, so narrowing `distros` to one value pins every row to it rather than reducing the run."
msgstr "Oba bazena hranita nalogo, tako zožita `distros` za eno vrednost pripne vsako vrstico do nje, namesto da bi zmanjšal tek."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both renderers fail loudly when Jinja markers cannot be resolved so generated configs never silently leak unrendered placeholders."
msgstr "Oba izrisovalca glasno spodletita, ko Jinja označevalcev ni mogoče rešiti tako ustvarjenih konfigov nikoli ne tiho puščajo neodkritih lokalistov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both requirement files name the same collections at the same versions: the Galaxy file is the normal source, the git file the fallback used when galaxy.ansible.com is unreachable. A bump that touches only one of them would make the fallback install something the pin does not describe, so an update is applied to both or to neither."
msgstr "Obe datoteki z zahtevo poimenujeta iste zbirke v istih različicah: datoteka Galaxy je običajen vir, datoteka git, ki se uporablja, ko galaxy.ansible.com je nedosegljiv. Izboklina, ki se dotakne samo enega od njih, bi naredila rezervno namestitev nekaj, česar pin ne opisuje, zato se posodobitev uporabi za oboje ali za nobeno."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both run from the trusted workflow ref and check out the version tag for the actual build payload, so the release artefacts match the tagged commit byte-for-byte."
msgstr "Oboje teče od zaupanja vreden potek dela ref in preverite oznako različice za dejansko gradnjo koristnega tovora, tako da se sprosti artefakti ujemajo z označenim za-bajt."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both sections are merged per entry, so an inventory that names one field keeps the rest of the declaration, and a key nobody declared is added."
msgstr "Oba oddelka se združita za vsak vnos, tako da se doda popis, ki poimenuje eno polje, obdrži preostanek deklaracije in ključ, ki ga nihče ni prijavil."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both sides pass `primary_apps` (not the round closure) as the BFS seed and the variant-merged services map for that round, so the reachability walk sees the same topology the inventory baked."
msgstr "Obe strani gresta mimo. `primary_apps` (ne zaokroženo zaprtje) Kot seme BFS in zemljevid za različne storitve za to rundo, tako da dosegljiva hoja vidi isto topologijo inventar pečen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Both sources carry the same pinned collections, so the only thing separating them is how long they take and whether they answer at all. A single slow day says nothing: galaxy.ansible.com degrades and recovers, and a git clone can stall on one runner. The default is therefore retuned only when a rolling window of daily samples shows one source durably behind the other."
msgstr "Oba vira nosita iste vezane zbirke, tako da ju loči samo to, kako dolgo trajata in ali sploh odgovarjata. En počasen dan ne pove ničesar: galaxy.ansible.com Poslabšuje in okreva, in git klon lahko zavlačuje na enem tekaču. Privzeto je torej ponovno uglašeno samo, če se za oknom dnevnih vzorcev trajno prikaže en vir za drugim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format
msgid "Both targets (Debian changelog and the RPM ``%changelog`` section) are fully regenerated on every run from the kept entries plus an archived-releases notice that points at the documentation site and lists the archived versions and dates as plain text. The notice is folded into the body of the oldest kept entry (not appended after the last entry), because free text after the final entry is not valid changelog data and makes the native parsers warn. Because the package files are regenerated, they cannot drift from the CHANGELOG.md SPOT."
msgstr "Oba cilja (Debian Changelog in RPM ``%changelog`` oddelek) so popolnoma regenerirani na vsakem zagonu iz shranjenih vnosov in obvestilo o arhiviranih izpustih, ki kaže na strani dokumentacije in navaja arhivirane različice in datume kot navadno besedilo. Obvestilo je zloženo v telo najstarejšega varovanega vstopa. (ni priložen po zadnjem vnosu), ker je prosto besedilo po končnem vnosu ni veljavno Changelog podatkov in naredi domači razčlenjevalci opozarja. Ker so paketne datoteke regenerirane, se ne morejo oddaljiti od CHANGELOG.md SPOT."

