# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Docker compose stores that key in the ``com.docker.compose.network`` label of every network it owns, so a caller pre-creating the network out of band has to stamp the same value or compose will resolve the project's networks against a claim the rendered file does not make. The key is derived from ``utils.networks.render``, which renders the file itself, so the two cannot drift."
msgstr "Docker sklada, da je ključ v ``com.docker.compose.network`` oznaka vsakega omrežja, ki ga ima v lasti, tako da mora klicatelj, ki predustvarja omrežje iz pasu, žigosati enako vrednost ali pa bo komponiranje rešilo omrežja projekta na podlagi zahtevka, ki ga datoteka nima. Ključ je izpeljan iz ``utils.networks.render``, ki naredi datoteko sama, tako da dva ne more premakniti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Docker defaults to MTU 1500. If the host outbound interface uses a smaller MTU (e.g. due to VPN, tunnels, or jumbo-frame negotiation failure), packets MAY be dropped or fragmented and TLS handshakes time out mid-flight (see the diagnose tool's classic-failure shape above)."
msgstr "Docker privzeto za MTU 1500. Če gostitelj izhodni vmesnik uporablja manjši MTU (npr. zaradi okvare VPN, predorov ali jumbo okvirja), paketi se lahko spustijo ali fragmentirajo in TLS rokovanje čas ven sredi leta (glej klasično obliko diagnoze orodja)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Docker defaults to stop-first, but a rolling update that ever started a second task against the same raft directory would corrupt the store, so the role states it explicitly rather than inheriting it. Precedent: [`svc-prx-openresty`](../../roles/svc-prx-openresty/templates/compose.yml.j2)."
msgstr "Docker privzeto stop-prve, vendar rolling posodobitev, ki je kdaj začela drugo nalogo proti istemu imeniku splava bi pokvaril trgovino, zato je vloga izrecno navaja, namesto podedovanja. Precedent: [`svc-prx-openresty`](../../roles/svc-prx-openresty/templates/compose.yml.j2)."

