msgid "Every non-empty body line gets a ``- `` continuation prefix so rpm does not read a markdown ``*`` bullet at column 0 as a new changelog entry header (which makes ``rpmspec`` report ``bad date``). Blank lines stay blank. *footer_md* (the archived-releases notice) is folded into this entry's body for the same reason it is on the Debian side: trailing free text confuses the parser."
msgstr "Vsaka neprazna linija telesa dobi ``- `` predpona za nadaljevanje, tako da rpm ne odčita oznake ``*`` krogla v koloni 0 kot nova glava za vnos v dnevnik sprememb (ki pomeni ``rpmspec`` poročilo ``bad date``). Prazne črte ostanejo prazne. *footer_md* (obvestilo o arhiviranju) je zložena v telo tega vstopa iz istega razloga, kot je na Debian strani: sledenje prostega besedila zmede parser."

