# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every path that cannot route rejects the request with its reason instead of answering. The hook returns a string when the proxy has no router or when no served model can take the request, and the proxy turns that into a `RejectedRequestError` carrying the text. The alias's own `model_list` entry exists only so the name is listable and carries `mock_response: litellm.InternalServerError`, so reaching it at all raises. Both halves matter, because a router that silently served whatever was first would hide its own failure behind a plausible reply, and the alias exists precisely so callers do not have to know which model answered."
msgstr "Vsaka pot, ki ne more ukreniti, zavrne zahtevo s svojim razlogom namesto odgovora. Kljuka vrne niz, ko posrednik nima usmerjevalnika ali ko noben model ne more sprejeti zahteve, in posrednik to spremeni v a `RejectedRequestError` s sporočilom. Alias je lasten. `model_list` vnos obstaja samo zato, da je ime na seznamu in nosi `mock_response: litellm.InternalServerError`, tako ga doseže na vseh vzponih. Obe polovici sta pomembni, saj bi usmerjevalnik, ki je molče služil, karkoli je bilo prej, za verjetnim odgovorom skril svoj neuspeh, pri čemer obstaja tudi psevdonim, zato klicateljem ni treba vedeti, kateri model je odgovoril."

