msgid "Exempted by `# nocheck: header-trust`, each with the reason its marker states:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Exempts a Playwright-enabled `web-app-*` seaweedfs consumer from shipping `files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js` gated on `skipUnlessServiceEnabled(\"seaweedfs\")`. Place in the head of `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Reserved for a role whose seaweedfs flag carries no user-facing document surface, e.g. one that enables the service only to join the provider's shared network."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` line in `roles/<role>/templates/playwright.env.j2` from the \"must be gated in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`\" check."
msgstr "Izvzetje a `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` vrstica v `roles/<role>/templates/playwright.env.j2` iz \"Mora biti zaklenjeno. `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`\" Preveri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a `requirements/requirements.galaxy.yml` collection from the requirement to also carry a `type: git` entry in `requirements/requirements.git.yml`. Reserved for collections that publish no usable git remote; without the git entry a `galaxy.ansible.com` outage fails `make install`, because the fallback in `scripts/install/ansible.sh` cannot resolve the collection either."
msgstr "Izvzetje a `requirements/requirements.galaxy.yml` pobiranje iz zahteve po nošenju `type: git` vnos `requirements/requirements.git.yml`. Rezervirano za zbirke, ki ne objavljajo uporabne Git daljinsko; brez vnosa git a `galaxy.ansible.com` izpad ni uspel `make install`, ker nazaj v `scripts/install/ansible.sh` tudi zbirke ne more rešiti."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` healthcheck flavor from the requirement that the role's `files/Dockerfile` install the binary the probe runs, when the service sits on a `-slim` image. MUST name where the binary comes from instead. A `-slim` tag carries the runtime and nothing around it, so `curl` is absent and the probe fails from the first beat; under swarm the task is then reaped with exit 137 and every deployment holding the service in its closure fails on the convergence wait, naming the service rather than the missing binary."
msgstr "Izvzetje a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` okus zdravstvenega preverjanja iz zahteve, da je vloga `files/Dockerfile` namestite binarno sondo teče, ko storitev sedi na a `-slim` slike. MORATE imenovati, od kod prihaja binarna. A `-slim` Tag nosi čas in nič okoli njega, tako da `curl` je odsoten in sonda spodleti iz prvega udarca; pod rojom se naloga nato žanje z izhodom 137 in vsaka uvedba, ki ima storitev pri zaprtju ne uspe na konvergenco čakati, imenuje storitev namesto manjkajoče binarne."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a `roles/*/templates/*compose.yml.j2` line, or the whole file (head marker), from the canonical compose skeleton: base-include header, `{{ service_name }}:` service keys each preceded by their `{% set service_name %}`, all per-service `{% set %}` knobs on two-space-indented dash-free lines above the key, `{% include %}` at four spaces inside the service body, and column-0 `compose_volumes` / `compose_networks` at the tail. The layout renders correctly because the `stack_host_template` action plugin sets `lstrip_blocks=True` for `compose.yml.j2`. Reserved for legitimate deviations that genuinely cannot follow the skeleton."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a `when` / `failed_when` / `changed_when` / `until` value that legitimately carries `{{ }}` / `{% %}`. Reserved for genuine edge cases; the default path is a bare expression. Per-item render/apply data guards belong on a `condition:` data field (honored by the sys-svc-compose render helper and `LISTMONK_SETTINGS`), not `when:`."
msgstr "Izvzetje a `when` / `failed_when` / `changed_when` / `until` vrednost, ki jo zakonito prenaša `{{ }}` / `{% %}`. Rezervirano za pristne primere robov; privzeta pot je goli izraz. Per-item izris/uporabno varstvo podatkov spada na a `condition:` podatkovno polje (počaščeni s strani sys-svc-compose pomočnik in `LISTMONK_SETTINGS`), ne `when:`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a database-backed `web-app-*` role from the requirement to declare a seaweedfs object-store service. Place in the head of `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Use only when the application genuinely needs no object storage."
msgstr "Izvzetje zbirke podatkov `web-app-*` vlogo, ki izhaja iz zahteve po prijavi storitve trgovine s predmeti morskih alg. Kraj v glavi `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Uporabite samo, če aplikacija resnično ne potrebuje shranjevanje predmetov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a deprecated `add_header` / `Header set/add` line for `X-Frame-Options` / `X-XSS-Protection` / `X-Download-Options` / `X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies`. Prefer Content-Security-Policy via the role's `meta/server.yml` (`csp.flags` / `csp.whitelist`)."
msgstr "Oprošča amortizirano `add_header` / `Header set/add` vrstica za `X-Frame-Options` / `X-XSS-Protection` / `X-Download-Options` / `X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies`. Prefer Content-Varnost-Politika preko vloge je `meta/server.yml` (`csp.flags` / `csp.whitelist`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a domain-serving role (`web-`/`svc-db-` prefix or explicit `domains.canonical`) from the \"must declare a `tor:` block in `meta/services.yml`\" contract. Reserved for roles with no onion surface, e.g. pure redirect helpers."
msgstr "Izvzema vlogo, ki služi domeni (`web-`/`svc-db-` predpona ali izrecna `domains.canonical`) iz \"mora prijaviti `tor:` blok v `meta/services.yml`\" pogodba. Rezervirano za vloge brez čebulne površine, npr. čistih pomočnikov za preusmeritev."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a server-capable `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` from the \"must carry a `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated `services.<client-entity>` entry for every role declaring `mcp_consumer: true`\" check. Reserved for a provider that legitimately owns no co-deploy edge to its clients."
msgstr "Izvzame strežnika z možnostjo `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` iz \"mora nositi `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`- gatiran `services.<client-entity>` vnos za vsako prijavo vloge `mcp_consumer: true`\" Preveri. Rezervirano za ponudnika, ki legitimno nima prednosti sodelovanja s strankami."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a server-capable `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` from the \"must ship one `meta/variants.yml` entry enabling every admitted consumer, with `sso` pinned on, and pulling in a consumer variant that does not pin `sso: false`\" check. Reserved for a provider whose pairing is genuinely proven elsewhere."
msgstr "Izvzame strežnika z možnostjo `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` iz \"mora biti ladja ena `meta/variants.yml` vstop, ki omogoča vsakemu sprejetemu potrošniku, `sso` pripeto in vlečeno v potrošniško varianto, ki ni pripeta `sso: false`\" Preveri. Rezervirano za ponudnika, katerega par je resnično dokazan drugje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a top-level key in `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` or `group_vars/**/*.yml` from the \"must be referenced\" check. Use when the consumer is non-YAML/Jinja (Python plugins, external tools)."
msgstr "Izvzetje najvišjega ključa v `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` ali `group_vars/**/*.yml` iz \"je treba navesti\" Preveri. Uporaba, kadar je potrošnik ne-YAML/Jinja (Python vstavki, zunanja orodja)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a top-level service in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` from the \"must be registered as `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`\" check."
msgstr "Izvzetje najvišje storitve v `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` iz \"je treba registrirati kot `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` v `templates/playwright.env.j2`\" Preveri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts an auth-isolated variant entry in `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` (one that enables exactly one of LDAP / OIDC / OAuth2) from the rule that every non-auth service-key in the role's variant union must be pinned to literal `false`. Place on the leading `- services:` line of the variant or on the line above. Use only when the broader closure is intentional."
msgstr "Izvzetje variantnega vnosa v auth-izolirani `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` (ki omogoča točno enega od LDAP / OIDC / OAuth2) iz pravila, da mora biti vsak neavtomatski ključ v variantni uniji vloge vezan na dobesedno `false`. Postavite na vodilne `- services:` linija variante ali na zgornji črti. Uporabite le, če je širše zaprtje namerno."

msgid "Exempts an invokable role from declaring a `garbage_collector` collector in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Place in the head of that file. MUST name after the rule why the role collects nothing; a bare marker is rejected, and a role carrying the marker MUST NOT also declare `garbage_collector`. See [garbage_collector.sh.md](../../artefact/files/role/garbage_collector.sh.md)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Exempts one `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>.shared: false` pin from the one-local-provider-variant limit for a service whose base `meta/services.yml` uses literal `enabled: true` and dynamic `shared`. Place on the extra `shared: false` line or service key line. Place above the service key in `meta/services.yml` to exempt the service."
msgstr "Izvzetje enega `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>.shared: false` pin od mejne vrednosti za enolokalno ponudbo za storitev, katere osnova `meta/services.yml` uporablja dobesedno `enabled: true` in dinamična `shared`. Kraj na extra `shared: false` linija za linijske ali servisne ključe. Postavite nad ključ storitve v `meta/services.yml` izvzetje storitve."

