msgstr "Za vsak vnos addona z neprazno `bridges:` seznam, vsak navedeni ključ storitev MORA biti deklariran kot blok storitev v isti vlogi `meta/services.yml`, v skladu z uveljavljenim vzorcem navzkrižne zastave."

msgid "For every affected documentation file, you MUST optimize the text so it follows the standards defined in [documentation.md](../../../docs/contributing/documentation.md), including RFC 2119 keywords, link formatting, and writing style."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "For every marker entry declared anywhere in :data:`utils.roles.mapping.ROLE_FILES` the predicate reads the role's file at the entry's dotted path. Each marker that resolves to a non-empty string adds the surrounding type to the result."
msgstr "Za vsak vnos označevalca, naveden kjer koli v :data:`utils.roles.mapping.ROLE_FILES` Predikant prebere dosje o vlogi na vstopni poti. Vsak označevalec, ki razreši neprazno struno, doda bližnji vrsti rezultat."

msgid "For every role under roles_dir whose meta/services.yml defines a service listed in `services`, set enabled: false and shared: false in host_vars_file under applications.<app_id>.services.<svc_name>.  Missing application or services blocks are created as needed. The same happens to every entry whose base `enabled` is the presence test of a disabled provider role (:func:`find_presence_dependents`), so a variant's literal pin cannot keep it on once that provider leaves the inventory."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "For every role with `meta/variants.yml`, return the services map that results from merging the round's variant payload onto the role's on-disk `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "Za vsako vlogo z `meta/variants.yml`, vrnitev zemljevida storitev, ki je rezultat združitve obremenitve različice kroga na časovni okvir vloge `meta/services.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "For example, `web-app-nextcloud` owns the Nextcloud deployment, `sys-svc-webserver-https` owns the HTTPS plumbing, and `sys-ctl-cln-docker` handles Docker cleanup."
msgstr "Na primer: `web-app-nextcloud` je lastnik Nextcloud uporaba, `sys-svc-webserver-https` je lastnik vodovoda HTTPS in `sys-ctl-cln-docker` ročaji Docker čiščenje."

