msgid "Neither strategy is chosen by hand. `services.litellm.router.strategy` derives from `services.s1.enabled`: with the System One service deployed the gateway asks it, and without it there is nothing to ask, so the gateway falls to `weighted`, the strategy it can compute itself. Reading the service flag rather than `group_names` keeps one path from the deployment to the behaviour."
