# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Per-consumer provisioning (``tasks/01_init.yml``) runs with ``application_id=svc-db-rabbitmq`` and ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; it resolves the consumer’s vhost name, username and password via ``lookup('engine', 'rabbitmq', <consumer>, ...)`` and reconciles an idempotent vhost, user and ``set_permissions`` grant scoped to that vhost. Existing vhosts and users are skipped, and the consumer password is realigned with the inventory on every deploy."
msgstr "Zagotavljanje na potrošnika (``tasks/01_init.yml``) teče z ``application_id=svc-db-rabbitmq`` ter ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; rešuje potrošnikovo ime vhost, uporabniško ime in geslo preko ``lookup('engine', 'rabbitmq', <consumer>, ...)`` in usklajuje idempotent vhost, uporabnik in ``set_permissions`` Podarite tega vhosta. Obstoječe vhosts in uporabniki so preskočili, in geslo za potrošnike je prerazporediti z inventarjem na vsaki uporabi."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Per-consumer provisioning (``tasks/01_init.yml``) runs with ``application_id=svc-db-redis`` and ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; it resolves the consumer’s username, password and key-prefix via ``lookup('engine', 'redis', <consumer>, ...)`` and reconciles an idempotent ``ACL SETUSER`` restricted to ``~{entity}:*``. The ACL users are recreated by the consumer’s ``01_init`` on every deploy, so a container restart that drops the in-memory ACL set is healed on the next run."
msgstr "Zagotavljanje na potrošnika (``tasks/01_init.yml``) teče z ``application_id=svc-db-redis`` ter ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; rešuje potrošnikovo uporabniško ime, geslo in predpono s ključem ``lookup('engine', 'redis', <consumer>, ...)`` in uskladi idempotent ``ACL SETUSER`` omejeno na ``~{entity}:*``. Uporabnike ACL poustvarijo potrošniki ``01_init`` pri vsaki uporabi, tako da se posoda, ki pade v spomin ACL set je zaceljena v naslednjem teku."

