msgid "The `cli.contributing.mirror.cleanup` module deletes GHCR container packages filtered by prefix and visibility. Use it to remove stale private mirror packages that were pushed before the repository switched to `GITHUB_TOKEN`-based authentication (which now makes packages public automatically)."
msgstr "– `cli.contributing.mirror.cleanup` modul izbriše pakete GHCR, filtrirane s predpono in vidljivostjo. Uporabite ga za odstranitev zastarelih paketov zasebnega zrcala, ki so bili potisnjeni preden je skladišče preklopilo na `GITHUB_TOKEN`- osnovana overitev (ki zdaj samodejno objavi pakete)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
