msgid "The `rbac_group_path` lookup plugin is the only sanctioned producer of OIDC group paths in this repository. Tests in this directory MUST cover invariants that protect that contract: callsite shape, role declaration consistency, and the ban on inline `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` constructions introduced by requirement 005."
msgstr "– `rbac_group_path` Vstavek za iskanje je edini sankcionirani proizvajalec poti skupine OIDC v tem skladišču. Testi v tem imeniku MORAJO zajemati spremenljivke, ki varujejo to pogodbo: forma klica, skladnost izjave o vlogi in prepoved vnašanja `[RBAC.GROUP.NAME, ...] | path_join` konstrukcije, uvedene z zahtevo 005."

# translated-by: libretranslate
