msgid "The `vars/main.yml` of the role MUST define the variables referenced in `args:` by reading them from `meta/services.yml` through the `lookup('config', ...)` filter. This keeps `meta/services.yml` as the single source of truth."
msgstr "– `vars/main.yml` vlogo MORAJO opredeliti spremenljivke, navedene v `args:` z branjem od `meta/services.yml` skozi `lookup('config', ...)` filter. To ohranja `meta/services.yml` kot edini vir resnice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `version:` MUST stay pinned to an exact Playwright version and distro pair such as `v1.59.1-noble`. You MUST NOT switch this to a mutable tag such as `latest`, because mutable upstream tags are more vulnerable to CDN propagation delays and make flaky CI failures much harder to reason about."
msgstr "– `version:` MORAJO ostati pritrjeni na natančno različico Playwright in distro par, kot so `v1.59.1-noble`. Ne smete preklopiti na mutable značke, kot so `latest`, ker so mutabilne oznake v zgornjem toku bolj dovzetne za zamude pri širjenju CDN in zaradi česar je veliko težje razmišljati o nejasnih napakah KI."

msgid "The `vpn` input does the same for the WireGuard mesh on swarm rows: `auto` rotates it, `enforced` meshes every swarm row and `disabled` none. A compose row never takes the mesh. `meshes` names the WireGuard layout a meshed row deploys, empty meaning `INFINITO_SWARM_MESHES` from `default.env`; pointing it at an `inventories/examples/*/wireguard.yml` with `vpn: enforced` and `mode: swarm` is how an example is deployed in CI."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `🛡️ Trusted` label flips the build source to the PR head and unlocks the Docker Hub credentials; without it the safe base merge ref is built with no organization secrets. Restrict who may set the label via repository label permissions / branch protection so only maintainers can grant it."
msgstr "– `🛡️ Trusted` nalepka obrne gradbeni vir na glavo PR in odklene poverilnice Docker Hub; brez nje je varna baza združi ref zgrajena brez skrivnosti organizacije. Omejite, kdo lahko nastavite nalepko preko dovoljenj za označevanje/zaščite podružnic, tako da jo lahko odobrijo le vzdrževalci."

# translated-by: libretranslate
