# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge declaration is one-directional metadata (this role depends on that service). It MUST NOT be used to auto-enable the other role; enablement stays driven by group membership and the existing `run_after` ordering."
msgstr "Mostna deklaracija je enosmerni metapodatki (ta vloga je odvisna od te storitve). Ne sme se uporabljati za samodejno omogoÄ anje druge vloge; omogoÄ itev bivanja, ki ga poganjajo člani skupine in obstoječe `run_after` Naroči."

msgid "The bridge has two halves. Inside Blender an add-on opens a local socket; outside it the ``mcp-for-blender`` server speaks the Model Context Protocol over stdio and relays to that socket. Both halves come from the same pinned upstream distribution, which also carries the ``install-addon`` subcommand this role uses to place the Blender side."
msgstr ""

msgid "The bridge has two halves. Inside Blender an add-on opens a local socket; outside it the `mcp-for-blender` server speaks the Model Context Protocol over stdio and relays to that socket. Both halves come from the same pinned upstream distribution, which also carries the `install-addon` subcommand this role uses to place the Blender side."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The bridge ships as a **separate component** (own sidecar/role), not inside `web-app-atmo`, gated on `web-app-mobilizon in group_names`."
msgstr "Mostne ladje kot **ločena komponenta** (lastne stranske prikolice/role), ne znotraj `web-app-atmo`, zaklenjeno `web-app-mobilizon in group_names`."

msgid "The bridge signs in to Mobilizon's GraphQL API as `atmo_bridge`, the local account `web-app-mobilizon-atmo-bridge` that [web-app-mobilizon](../web-app-mobilizon/meta/users.yml) declares. The account holds the Mobilizon role `user` and its own password, which the inventory pins for it like for every declared user, so no credential of the platform administrator reaches the bridge. `web-app-mobilizon` creates it with a profile whenever this role's `bridge` flag is on, and events are published as that profile. This needs Mobilizon's database login, which `web-app-mobilizon` switches off when its native login method is off."
