msgid "The pin stays anyway, and removing it as redundant breaks the login again: `\\core\\files\\curl_security_helper::host_is_blocked()` performs a forward `gethostbynamel()` whenever any IP rule is configured and returns blocked when the name does not resolve, so without `/etc/hosts` the Keycloak authority is rejected inside Moodle before libcurl is reached."
msgstr ""

msgid "The pin stays anyway, and removing it as redundant breaks the login again: ``\\core\\files\\curl_security_helper::host_is_blocked()`` performs a forward ``gethostbynamel()`` whenever any IP rule is configured and returns blocked when the name does not resolve, so without ``/etc/hosts`` the Keycloak authority is rejected inside Moodle before libcurl is reached."
