msgid "The renderer sets every match read-only (`disabled` for a `select`) and `aria-readonly`, and shows the `locked` text of [profile_lock_i18n.yml](../../../../../roles/sys-front-inj-javascript/files/profile_lock_i18n.yml) in the page language as the hover title of the field, its labels and its wrapping element. It matches every selector with one query at load and again once per animation frame after the page adds elements. Selectors and catalogue reach the page through the `to_inline_js` filter. New texts reach the other languages through `make i18n-extract domain=core` and `make i18n-translate`."
