msgid "The token can name a row this ranking no longer has -- the role was removed, a variant was dropped, the filters moved. The start is then the first row the source run got green, which lies inside the same window and so never falls behind it. A run with nothing green and an unresolvable token leaves no anchor at all and starts at the head."
msgstr "Žeton lahko poimenuje vrsto, ki je ta uvrstitev nima več -- vloga je bila odstranjena, varianta je padla, filtri so se premaknili. Začetek je potem prva vrsta, ki jo je vir pognal, postala zelena, ki leži znotraj istega okna in tako nikoli ne pade za njim. Tek z nič zelenega in nerešljivim žetonom sploh ne zapusti sidra in se začne pri glavi."

