# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is an accepted trade-off, not an oversight. Moodle offers no allowlist, so a single internal host cannot be permitted without unblocking the range it sits in. The cost is that any account holding a URL-fetching capability, such as ``block/rss_client:myaddinstance`` or a ``repository/url`` instance, can make the server issue requests to sibling containers. Grant those capabilities only to roles you trust with that reach, or keep the upstream blocklist and accept that SSO login and the AI surface do not work."
msgstr "To je sprejet kompromis, ne pregled. Moodle ne ponuja seznama dovoljenj, zato enega samega notranjega gostitelja ni mogoče dovoliti, ne da bi odblokiral obseg, v katerem sedi. Stroški so, da vsak račun, ki ima zmogljivost za pridobivanje URL, kot so ``block/rss_client:myaddinstance`` ali a ``repository/url`` na primer, lahko server izdajo zahteve za posode za brate in sestre. Dodelite te zmožnosti le vlogam, ki jim zaupate v ta doseg, ali pa obdržite zgornji seznam blokov in se sprijaznite, da prijava SSO in površina AI ne delujeta."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This is an accepted trade-off, not an oversight. Moodle offers no allowlist, so a single internal host cannot be permitted without unblocking the range it sits in. The cost is that any account holding a URL-fetching capability, such as `block/rss_client:myaddinstance` or a `repository/url` instance, can make the server issue requests to sibling containers. Grant those capabilities only to roles you trust with that reach, or keep the upstream blocklist and accept that SSO login and the AI surface do not work."
msgstr "To je sprejet kompromis, ne pregled. Moodle ne ponuja seznama dovoljenj, zato enega samega notranjega gostitelja ni mogoče dovoliti, ne da bi odblokiral obseg, v katerem sedi. Stroški so, da vsak račun, ki ima zmogljivost za pridobivanje URL, kot so `block/rss_client:myaddinstance` ali a `repository/url` na primer, lahko server izdajo zahteve za posode za brate in sestre. Dodelite te zmožnosti le vlogam, ki jim zaupate v ta doseg, ali pa obdržite zgornji seznam blokov in se sprijaznite, da prijava SSO in površina AI ne delujeta."

