msgid "This page covers the role-local garbage collector and the `garbage_collector` declaration every invokable role carries. Use this page for the declaration, the script contract, its registration and the lint. The dispatcher that runs the scripts is [sys-ctl-cln-apps](../../../../../roles/sys-ctl-cln-apps/README.md)."
