# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` in `templates/env.j2`); the resulting entry point is `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, relabelled \"SSO with Infinito.Nexus\" by `templates/javascript.js.j2`, which the shared helper's name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a `/landing` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ter `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2` za isti mehanizem. Najvažnejša ekipa Edition ladje ni domači OIDC ponudnik, tako da je vloga prašički Keycloak na GitLab Reža OAuth (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` v `templates/env.j2`); nastala vstopna točka je `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, ponovno označena \"SSO z Infinito.Nexus\" z `templates/javascript.js.j2`, ki jih skupni pomočnik na osnovi imena prijavitelja ne prepozna. Snov v11+ služi tudi `/landing` intersticijski do neavtentiranih obiskovalcev, ki se očistijo samo enkrat `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` je posejana pred navigacijo, in skupni pomočnik nima init-script kavelj za to."

msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — `/api/v1/login` answers `redirectRules: null` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because MinIO policies exist only for the RBAC group paths (`MINIO_RBAC_POLICIES` in `vars/main.yml`) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber without one of those groups maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Both personas are blocked by `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin`, which this role sets to true in `vars/main.yml`: every anonymous request is bounced straight back into the identity provider, so the verified unauthenticated landing after in-app logout that the persona contract demands can never be observed here. The path back to the generic personas is auto-login off."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak provides SSO rather than consuming it: `meta/services.yml` carries no `sso` block (the `keycloak` service declares `provides: sso`) and pins `logout.enabled: false`, so the canonical URL has neither an oauth2-proxy gate nor an in-app OIDC login link for the shared persona helpers to click or log out of. The administrator persona is additionally out of reach because Keycloak's only admin surface is the master-realm console, which accepts the permanent super-admin account (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` in `vars/main.yml`) under its own login name and not the normal-realm one the helper types."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailu's OIDC fork interposes its own `/sso/login` page that carries a local login form next to an `openid-connect/auth` link, while the authenticated Roundcube surface carries an `openid-connect/logout` link; the shared helper matches login controls by accessible name and cannot tell the two apart, so it clicks logout. The administrator persona is blocked for a second, independent reason: Mailu's admin surface is a separate Flask app mounted at `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), not the `/webmail/` surface the OIDC callback lands on."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ter `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` v `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailujeve vilice OIDC posegajo v svoje `/sso/login` stran, ki nosi lokalni prijavni obrazec poleg `openid-connect/auth` povezava, medtem ko overovana površina okrogle kocke nosi `openid-connect/logout` povezava; skupni pomočnik ujema prijavne kontrole z dostopnim imenom in ne more razlikovati med dvema, zato klikne odjavo. Administrator persona je blokiran iz drugega, neodvisnega razloga: Mailu je admin površina je ločena Flask aplikacija nameščena na `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), ne `/webmail/` Na površini OIDC pristanejo klici."

msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle's site administrator is created by `install_database.php` in `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` and realigned on every pass, both from the `platform_administrator` user, so the native form and the identity provider carry one secret. In the SSO variant `tasks/05_login_methods.yml` sets `alternateloginurl` so `/login/index.php` bounces to the OIDC plugin and `tasks/04_oidc.yml` rewrites every `mdl_user` row to `auth='oidc'`, so no form accepts either secret; the SSO-off variants in `meta/variants.yml` have no OIDC chain to substitute. One env file is rendered per role, not per variant, so the flag has to hold for the worst case."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX sits behind an oauth2-proxy whose `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml` admits only `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` and `roles/web-app-kix/user`; biber belongs to neither, so the proxy denies him before KIX renders anything. Past the proxy KIX is a two-stage login: the SPA still presents its own agent form at `/auth` that binds against LDAP, and the shared persona helper has no second stage after the Keycloak round-trip."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`` in ``templates/env.j2``); the resulting entry point is ``a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']``, relabelled “SSO with Infinito.Nexus” by ``templates/javascript.js.j2``, which the shared helper’s name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a ``/landing`` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once ``localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` ter ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` v ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` za isti mehanizem. Najvažnejša ekipa Edition ladje ni domači OIDC ponudnik, tako da je vloga prašički Keycloak na GitLab Reža OAuth (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`` v ``templates/env.j2``); nastala vstopna točka je ``a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']``, ponovno označeno “SSO z Infinito.Nexus“ ``templates/javascript.js.j2``, ki jih skupni pomočnik na osnovi imena prijavitelja ne prepozna. Snov v11+ služi tudi ``/landing`` intersticijski do neavtentiranih obiskovalcev, ki se očistijo samo enkrat ``localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`` je posejana pred navigacijo, in skupni pomočnik nima init-script kavelj za to."

msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — ``/api/v1/login`` answers ``redirectRules: null`` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because MinIO policies exist only for the RBAC group paths (``MINIO_RBAC_POLICIES`` in ``vars/main.yml``) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber without one of those groups maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Both personas are blocked by ``$wgPluggableAuth_EnableAutoLogin``, which this role sets to true in ``vars/main.yml``: every anonymous request is bounced straight back into the identity provider, so the verified unauthenticated landing after in-app logout that the persona contract demands can never be observed here. The path back to the generic personas is auto-login off."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Keycloak provides SSO rather than consuming it: ``meta/services.yml`` carries no ``sso`` block (the ``keycloak`` service declares ``provides: sso``) and pins ``logout.enabled: false``, so the canonical URL has neither an oauth2-proxy gate nor an in-app OIDC login link for the shared persona helpers to click or log out of. The administrator persona is additionally out of reach because Keycloak’s only admin surface is the master-realm console, which accepts the permanent super-admin account (``KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME`` / ``KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD`` in ``vars/main.yml``) under its own login name and not the normal-realm one the helper types."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Mailu’s OIDC fork interposes its own ``/sso/login`` page that carries a local login form next to an ``openid-connect/auth`` link, while the authenticated Roundcube surface carries an ``openid-connect/logout`` link; the shared helper matches login controls by accessible name and cannot tell the two apart, so it clicks logout. The administrator persona is blocked for a second, independent reason: Mailu’s admin surface is a separate Flask app mounted at ``WEB_ADMIN=/admin`` (``templates/env.j2``), not the ``/webmail/`` surface the OIDC callback lands on."
msgstr "Ta vloga izjavlja ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` ter ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` v ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Mailu je OIDC vilice posreduje svoje ``/sso/login`` stran, ki nosi lokalni prijavni obrazec poleg ``openid-connect/auth`` povezava, medtem ko overovana površina okrogle kocke nosi ``openid-connect/logout`` povezava; skupni pomočnik ujema prijavne kontrole z dostopnim imenom in ne more razlikovati med dvema, zato klikne odjavo. Administrator persona je blokiran iz drugega, neodvisnega razloga: Mailujeva admin površina je ločena Flask aplikacija, nameščena na ``WEB_ADMIN=/admin`` (``templates/env.j2``), ne ``/webmail/`` Na površini OIDC pristanejo klici."

msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. Moodle’s site administrator is created by ``install_database.php`` in ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` and realigned on every pass, both from the ``platform_administrator`` user, so the native form and the identity provider carry one secret. In the SSO variant ``tasks/05_login_methods.yml`` sets ``alternateloginurl`` so ``/login/index.php`` bounces to the OIDC plugin and ``tasks/04_oidc.yml`` rewrites every ``mdl_user`` row to ``auth='oidc'``, so no form accepts either secret; the SSO-off variants in ``meta/variants.yml`` have no OIDC chain to substitute. One env file is rendered per role, not per variant, so the flag has to hold for the worst case."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. KIX sits behind an oauth2-proxy whose ``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` in ``meta/services.yml`` admits only ``roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` and ``roles/web-app-kix/user``; biber belongs to neither, so the proxy denies him before KIX renders anything. Past the proxy KIX is a two-stage login: the SPA still presents its own agent form at ``/auth`` that binds against LDAP, and the shared persona helper has no second stage after the Keycloak round-trip."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role depends on ``sys-pip``, which ensures that ``pip`` is installed on the target system."
msgstr "Ta vloga je odvisna od ``sys-pip``, ki zagotavlja, da ``pip`` je vgrajen v ciljni sistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role depends on `sys-pip`, which ensures that `pip` is installed on the target system."
msgstr "Ta vloga je odvisna od `sys-pip`, ki zagotavlja, da `pip` je vgrajen v ciljni sistem."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploy Decidim, an open-source participatory democracy platform for public consultations, civic processes, community voting, and collaborative policy creation."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Decidim, odprtokodna platforma participativne demokracije za javna posvetovanja, državljanske procese, glasovanje v skupnosti in oblikovanje skupne politike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **LibreTranslate** as a containerized web service using Docker Compose. It is designed to integrate seamlessly into the Infinito.Nexus stack, including optional Redis and database backends, CSP handling, and analytics integration."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja **LibreTranslate** kot internetna storitev v zabojnikih Docker Compose. Zasnovan je za nemoteno vključitev v Infinito.Nexus sklad, vključno z neobvezno Redis in baze podatkov, ravnanje s CSP in povezovanje analitike."

msgid "This role deploys **LibreTranslate** as a plain translation engine, without a public vhost, reverse proxy, MCP adapter or analytics. Callers reach it over the container network and talk to its HTTP API directly."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Magento 2** via Docker Compose. It is aligned with the Infinito.Nexus stack patterns:"
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja **Magento 2** preko Docker Compose. Je usklajen z Infinito.Nexus vzorci sklada:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak's user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja **Shopware 6** uporaba **Docker**. Avtomatizira namestitev, migracijo in konfiguracijo vašega skladišča, povezovanje z osrednjim **MariaDB** podatkovna baza. Neobvezne komponente **Redis** ter **Odpri iskanje** izboljšati zmogljivost in zmogljivosti iskanja, **OIDC** integrira hrbtenico administracije z **Keycloak**. Mapa računov znak na enak način: Shopware nima admin-LDAP razširitev to vlogo lahko namestite, tako LDAP identitete priti skozi KeycloakUporabniška federacija namesto skozi svoj plugin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak’s user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja **Shopware 6** uporaba **Docker**. Avtomatizira namestitev, migracijo in konfiguracijo vašega skladišča, povezovanje z osrednjim **MariaDB** podatkovna baza. Neobvezne komponente **Redis** ter **Odpri iskanje** izboljšati zmogljivost in zmogljivosti iskanja, **OIDC** integrira hrbtenico administracije z **Keycloak**. Mapa računov znak na enak način: Shopware nima admin-LDAP razširitev to vlogo lahko namestite, tako LDAP identitete priti skozi Keycloakje uporabniška federacija namesto skozi plugin svoje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Baserow using Docker Compose, integrating key components such as PostgreSQL for the database, Redis for caching, and NGINX for secure domain management and certificate handling. It is designed to offer a robust, scalable solution for running your own Baserow instance in a containerized environment."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Baserow uporaba Docker Compose, ki vključuje ključne komponente, kot so PostgreSQL za zbirko podatkov, Redis za caching in NGINX za varno upravljanje domen in ravnanje s certifikati. Zasnovan je tako, da ponuja robustno, raztegljivo rešitev za delovanje svojega Baserow primer v kontejnerskem okolju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Coturn via Docker Compose using the ``sys-stk-semi-stateless`` stack."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Coturn preko Docker Compose uporaba ``sys-stk-semi-stateless`` kup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Coturn via Docker Compose using the `sys-stk-semi-stateless` stack.   It automatically configures:"
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Coturn preko Docker Compose uporaba `sys-stk-semi-stateless` kup. Samodejno nastavlja:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Discourse using Docker, automating tasks such as container orchestration, service configuration, and routine administrative operations. It integrates key components like Redis and PostgreSQL, sets up domain routing with NGINX, and ensures streamlined updates for a reliable forum experience."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Discourse uporaba Dockerja, avtomatizacija nalog, kot so orkestracija zabojnikov, konfiguracija storitev in rutinske upravne operacije. Vključuje ključne komponente, kot so Redis ter PostgreSQL, vzpostavi domene usmerjanje z NGINX, in zagotavlja poenostavljene posodobitve za zanesljivo forum izkušnje."

msgid "This role deploys ERPNext as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream ``frappe/erpnext`` single-image multi-role pattern from `frappe_docker <https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker>`__: one Docker image, different commands per container (backend gunicorn, frontend nginx, websocket socketio, scheduler, two queue workers, plus a one-shot configurator). MariaDB and Redis come from the central ``svc-db-mariadb`` and ``svc-db-redis`` providers — the three Frappe Redis logical roles (``cache``, ``queue``, ``socketio``) share one central Redis instance via DB-number split (0 / 1 / 2). Authentication uses Frappe’s built-in Social Login Key against the shared Keycloak OIDC client without an oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP federation and outbound SMTP via the mail server (`web-app-email <../web-app-email/>`__) are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys ERPNext as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream `frappe/erpnext` single-image multi-role pattern from [frappe_docker](https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker): one Docker image, different commands per container (backend gunicorn, frontend nginx, websocket socketio, scheduler, two queue workers, plus a one-shot configurator). MariaDB and Redis come from the central `svc-db-mariadb` and `svc-db-redis` providers — the three Frappe Redis logical roles (`cache`, `queue`, `socketio`) share one central Redis instance via DB-number split (0 / 1 / 2). Authentication uses Frappe's built-in Social Login Key against the shared Keycloak OIDC client without an oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP federation and outbound SMTP via the mail server ([web-app-email](../web-app-email/)) are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Fider as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using a single Docker Compose container backed by PostgreSQL. It configures SSO via Keycloak automatically on first deploy, optional email notifications via Mailu, and HTTPS via NGINX reverse proxy."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Fider kot del Infinito.Nexus kup z uporabo enega Docker Compose posoda s PostgreSQL. Nastavlja SSO preko Keycloak samodejno ob prvi uporabi, neobvezna elektronska obvestila preko Mailu, in HTTPS preko NGINX povratnega posrednika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Friendica using Docker, managing the Friendica application container alongside a central MariaDB instance. It provides tools for full resets, manual and automatic database reinitialization, email and general configuration debugging, and autoinstall processes, all to ensure your Friendica installation remains reliable and easy to maintain."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Friendica uporaba zdravila Docker, upravljanje Friendica Nanosni vsebnik poleg osrednjega MariaDB Primer. Zagotavlja orodja za popolno ponastavitev, ročno in avtomatsko ponovno vzpostavitev baze podatkov, e-pošto in splošne nastavitve razhroščevanje, in samodejno namestitev procesov, vse za zagotovitev vaše Friendica namestitev ostaja zanesljiva in enostavna za vzdrževanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Funkwhale using Docker. It orchestrates multiple services (including the API, Frontend, Celery Worker, Celery Beat, and Typesense) integrating with centralized PostgreSQL and Redis services for a fully containerized music sharing experience."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Funkwhale Uporaba zdravila Docker. Orkestruje več storitev (vključno z API, Frontend, Celery Worker, Celery Beat, in Typesense) povezovanje s centralizirano PostgreSQL ter Redis storitve za popolno izkušnjo souporabe glasbe."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys FusionDirectory on Docker Compose against the project's central `svc-db-openldap` server. The OIDC variant gates the FusionDirectory web UI through `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar for SSO; the LDAP variant relies on the same FusionDirectory binding to `svc-db-openldap` as its primary auth path. RBAC follows the LDAP group model that FusionDirectory already understands natively, so no glue layer is required for authorisation mapping."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja FusionDirectory o Docker Compose proti središču projekta `svc-db-openldap` strežnik. OIDC varianta vrata FusionDirectory spletni uporabniški vmesnik `web-app-keycloak`SSO-proxy sidecar za SSO; LDAP varianta se opira na isto FusionDirectory vezan na `svc-db-openldap` Kot njegova glavna pot. RBAC sledi modelu skupine LDAP, ki FusionDirectory Že razume domače, zato za kartiranje dovoljenj ni potrebna lepilna plast."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys FusionDirectory on Docker Compose against the project’s central ``svc-db-openldap`` server. The OIDC variant gates the FusionDirectory web UI through ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’s SSO-proxy sidecar for SSO; the LDAP variant relies on the same FusionDirectory binding to ``svc-db-openldap`` as its primary auth path. RBAC follows the LDAP group model that FusionDirectory already understands natively, so no glue layer is required for authorisation mapping."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja FusionDirectory o Docker Compose proti središču projekta ``svc-db-openldap`` strežnik. OIDC varianta vrata FusionDirectory spletni uporabniški vmesnik ``web-app-keycloak``\\ ’ SSO-proxy stranska prikolica za SSO; LDAP varianta se opira na isto FusionDirectory vezan na ``svc-db-openldap`` Kot njegova glavna pot. RBAC sledi modelu skupine LDAP, ki FusionDirectory Že razume domače, zato za kartiranje dovoljenj ni potrebna lepilna plast."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys GitLab from the official Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE images at ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` as separate services: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (sole HTTP entry point), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-sshd) and a one-shot ``migrations`` job. All images share a single version pin (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL, Redis and S3-compatible object storage are wired through the platform lookups (central or sidecar), OIDC and SMTP through the platform SSO and email services. The front proxy terminates TLS and forwards HTTP to workhorse."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja GitLab iz uradne Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) Slike CE na ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` kot ločene storitve: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (edina vstopna točka HTTP), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-sshd) in en strel. ``migrations`` Služba. Vse slike delijo eno različico pin (``services.webservice.version``)PostgreSQL, Redis in S3-združljivo shranjevanje predmetov je povezano z iskanjem platforme (osrednje ali stranske prikolice), OIDC in SMTP prek platforme SSO in e-poštnih storitev. Sprednji posrednik prekine TLS in HTTP pošlje na delo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys GitLab from the official Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE images at `registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/` as separate services: `webservice` (puma), `sidekiq`, `workhorse` (sole HTTP entry point), `gitaly`, `shell` (gitlab-sshd) and a one-shot `migrations` job. All images share a single version pin (`services.webservice.version`). PostgreSQL, Redis and S3-compatible object storage are wired through the platform lookups (central or sidecar), OIDC and SMTP through the platform SSO and email services. The front proxy terminates TLS and forwards HTTP to workhorse."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja GitLab iz uradne Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) Slike CE na `registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/` kot ločene storitve: `webservice` (puma), `sidekiq`, `workhorse` (edina vstopna točka HTTP), `gitaly`, `shell` (gitlab-sshd) in en strel. `migrations` Služba. Vse slike delijo eno različico pin (`services.webservice.version`)PostgreSQL, Redis in S3-združljivo shranjevanje predmetov je povezano z iskanjem platforme (osrednje ali stranske prikolice), OIDC in SMTP prek platforme SSO in e-poštnih storitev. Sprednji posrednik prekine TLS in HTTP pošlje na delo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Gitea using Docker. It automates the setup and update processes for your self-hosted Git service, integrating with a central MariaDB for the database. With functionalities for updating, recreating the container, variable management, database access, and shell access to the application container, this role streamlines the management of your Gitea instance. With Hermes Agent or OpenClaw deployed alongside it, the role adds a ``gitea-mcp`` sidecar and declares it as the MCP server of the deployment: an internal ``/mcp`` endpoint on the container network plus the Gitea personal access token that MCP clients present."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Gitea Uporaba zdravila Docker. To avtomatizira nastavitev in posodobitev procesov za vaš samogosti Git storitev, povezovanje z osrednjim MariaDB za bazo podatkov. S funkcionalnostmi za posodabljanje, poustvarjanje vsebnika, spremenljivo upravljanje, dostop do baze podatkov in lupinski dostop do vsebnika aplikacij, ta vloga racionalizira upravljanje vašega Gitea Primer. Z Hermes Agent ali OpenClaw Poleg tega je vloga še dodatna ``gitea-mcp`` stranska prikolica in jo razglasi za strežnik MCP uporabe: notranji ``/mcp`` končna točka omrežja zabojnikov in Gitea Osebni dostop, ki ga imajo stranke MCP."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Gitea using Docker. It automates the setup and update processes for your self-hosted Git service, integrating with a central MariaDB for the database. With functionalities for updating, recreating the container, variable management, database access, and shell access to the application container, this role streamlines the management of your Gitea instance. With Hermes Agent or OpenClaw deployed alongside it, the role adds a `gitea-mcp` sidecar and declares it as the MCP server of the deployment: an internal `/mcp` endpoint on the container network plus the Gitea personal access token that MCP clients present."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Gitea Uporaba zdravila Docker. To avtomatizira nastavitev in posodobitev procesov za vaš samogosti Git storitev, povezovanje z osrednjim MariaDB za bazo podatkov. S funkcionalnostmi za posodabljanje, poustvarjanje vsebnika, spremenljivo upravljanje, dostop do baze podatkov in lupinski dostop do vsebnika aplikacij, ta vloga racionalizira upravljanje vašega Gitea Primer. Z Hermes Agent ali OpenClaw Poleg tega je vloga še dodatna `gitea-mcp` stranska prikolica in jo razglasi za strežnik MCP uporabe: notranji `/mcp` končna točka omrežja zabojnikov in Gitea Osebni dostop, ki ga imajo stranke MCP."

msgid "This role deploys Hermes Agent in gateway mode as a Docker service, published behind the reverse proxy on its own subdomain, with its compose service pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host. The OpenAI-compatible API answers on the subdomain. The web dashboard is optional and off by default; switched on, it takes the subdomain root and the API stays under `/v1/` and `/health`. The API server is protected by a generated bearer key, and when the LiteLLM Gateway is part of the deployment the agent's model endpoint is pointed at that gateway with a per-consumer virtual key. Agent state lives in a named volume that the Backup Docker Volumes service captures when it is enabled."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys Hermes Agent in gateway mode as a Docker service, published behind the reverse proxy on its own subdomain, with its compose service pinned to the isolating runtime that the Kata & gVisor role selects for the host. The OpenAI-compatible API answers on the subdomain. The web dashboard is optional and off by default; switched on, it takes the subdomain root and the API stays under ``/v1/`` and ``/health``. The API server is protected by a generated bearer key, and when the LiteLLM Gateway is part of the deployment the agent’s model endpoint is pointed at that gateway with a per-consumer virtual key. Agent state lives in a named volume that the Backup Docker Volumes service captures when it is enabled."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Home Assistant as a container on its own canonical domain behind the reverse proxy, with the configuration directory kept in a persistent volume. It renders a ``configuration.yaml`` that trusts the proxy through ``use_x_forwarded_for`` and the project-wide trusted-proxy CIDRs, and it attaches the hub to a shared overlay network. With Hermes Agent deployed alongside it, the role declares the hub as the MCP server of the deployment: an internal ``/api/mcp`` endpoint plus the long-lived access token that MCP clients present."
msgstr "Ta vloga se uporablja Home Assistant kot vsebnik na svoji kanonični domeni za obratnim posrednikom, z nastavitveno mapo, ki se hrani v vztrajnem volumnu. To naredi a ``configuration.yaml`` ki zaupa posredniku skozi ``use_x_forwarded_for`` in projektno-zaupne CIDR-e, ki povezuje vozlišče s skupnim omrežjem. Z Hermes Agent ponujena poleg nje, vloga razglasi vozlišče kot MCP strežnik uporabe: notranji ``/api/mcp`` končna točka in dolgotrajen dostop, ki ga imajo stranke MCP."

