# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role frees disk space by executing a script that cleans up temporary files, clears package caches, and optionally cleans up backup directories and Docker resources when disk usage exceeds a specified threshold."
msgstr "Ta vloga sprosti prostor na disku z izvajanjem skripta, ki očisti začasne datoteke, počisti predpomnilnike paketov in po želji očisti varnostne mape in Docker vire, ko uporaba diska preseže določen prag."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role front bootstrap for web apps: HTTPS base, optional Cloudflare setup, and handler wiring."
msgstr "Ta vloga sprednji škornji Trap za spletne aplikacije: HTTPS baza, neobvezna nastavitev Cloudflare, in vodnik žice."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role generic role to manage reverse DNS (PTR) for Hetzner Cloud resources (server, primary_ip, floating_ip, load_balancer)."
msgstr "Ta vloga je splošna vloga pri upravljanju obrnjene DNS (PTR) za vire Hetzner Cloud (strežnik, primary_ip, floating_ip, load_balancer)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role gives every other role one place to put packet filter rules. A role that needs them writes ``templates/nftables.conf.j2`` declaring its own nftables table and includes this role; the fragment is rendered to ``/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf``, checked, loaded, and read back, so a deploy fails rather than quietly leaving a gap. Deployed on its own, the role installs nftables, the ruleset that loads every fragment, and the ``nftables.service`` that replays them at boot."
msgstr "Ta vloga daje vsaki drugi vlogi eno mesto za dajanje pravil za paketne filtre. Vloga, ki jih potrebuje za pisanje ``templates/nftables.conf.j2`` o razglasitvi lastne tabele ftables in vključuje to vlogo; fragment je narejen na ``/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf``, preveriti, naložiti, in brati nazaj, tako da razporeditev ne uspe, namesto tiho pušča vrzel. Samostojen, vloga namesti fttables, pravila, ki nalaga vsak fragment, in ``nftables.service`` Ki jih predvaja v škornju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role gives every other role one place to put packet filter rules. A role that needs them writes `templates/nftables.conf.j2` declaring its own nftables table and includes this role; the fragment is rendered to `/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf`, checked, loaded, and read back, so a deploy fails rather than quietly leaving a gap. Deployed on its own, the role installs nftables, the ruleset that loads every fragment, and the `nftables.service` that replays them at boot."
msgstr "Ta vloga daje vsaki drugi vlogi eno mesto za dajanje pravil za paketne filtre. Vloga, ki jih potrebuje za pisanje `templates/nftables.conf.j2` o razglasitvi lastne tabele ftables in vključuje to vlogo; fragment je narejen na `/etc/nftables.d/<role>.conf`, preveriti, naložiti, in brati nazaj, tako da razporeditev ne uspe, namesto tiho pušča vrzel. Samostojen, vloga namesti fttables, pravila, ki nalaga vsak fragment, in `nftables.service` Ki jih predvaja v škornju."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role guarantees the workstation account before any desktop role writes for it."
msgstr "Ta vloga zagotavlja račun delovne postaje pred katero koli namizno vlogo piše zanjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role health-check for Btrfs filesystems, alerts on any device error counters."
msgstr "Ta vloga, preverjanje zdravja za datotečne sisteme Btrfs, opozorila na vse števce napak naprave."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects Matomo analytics tracking code and noscript image tracker into Nginx-served HTML pages."
msgstr "Ta vloga vključuje Matomo analitika sledilne kode in noscript sledilnik slik v Nginx-served HTML strani."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects a JS snippet into HTML to notify parent windows of iframe location changes and force external links to new tabs."
msgstr "Ta vloga injicira snippet JS v HTML, da obvesti izvorna okna o spremembah lokacije iframe in prisili zunanje povezave do novih zavihkov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects a catcher that intercepts all logout elements in HTML pages served by NGINX and redirects them to a centralized logout endpoint via JavaScript."
msgstr "Ta vloga vbrizga lovilca, ki prestreže vse odjavne elemente v HTML straneh, ki jih služi NGINX, in jih preusmeri na centralizirano odjavo prek JavaScript."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role injects a custom JavaScript snippet into Nginx-served HTML responses via sub_filter."
msgstr "Ta vloga vnaša javascripte po meri v HTML odzive, ki jih hrani Nginx sub_filter."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs **GNOME Terminal**, the official terminal emulator for the GNOME desktop environment. GNOME Terminal provides a modern, feature-rich command-line interface for users on Arch Linux."
msgstr "Ta vloga vgrajuje **GNOME Terminal**, uradni terminalski emulator za namizno okolje GNOME. GNOME Terminal zagotavlja sodoben, funkcijsko bogat vmesnik ukazne vrstice za uporabnike na Arch Linuxu."

msgid "This role installs Blender on a workstation and connects it to the coding agents the same host deploys, so a model can drive the scene instead of only describing it."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs CA trust injection assets for compose (wrapper + inject script) and validates CA cert presence."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti sredstva za zavarovanje CA za sestavljanje (ovoj + skript za injiciranje) in potrjuje prisotnost CA cert."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs Epson multifunction printer drivers and scanning utilities (escpr, imagescan) via Pacman and AUR on Arch Linux."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti Epsonove večfunkcijske gonilnike tiskalnikov in naprave za skeniranje (escpr, slikecan) preko Pacmana in AUR na Arch Linuxu."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs GNOME Terminal on Arch Linux, providing a modern terminal emulator for the GNOME desktop environment."
msgstr "Ta vloga vgrajuje GNOME Terminal na Arch Linux, ki zagotavlja sodobni terminalski emulator za namizno okolje GNOME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs Git and configures it using a custom git-configurator for personal computers."
msgstr "Ta vloga vgrajuje Git in ga konfigurira z lastnim konfiguracijo za osebne računalnike."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs LibreOffice along with Liberation fonts and language packages on Arch Linux systems for a complete office suite experience."
msgstr "Ta vloga vgrajuje LibreOffice skupaj z Liberation pisave in jezikovne pakete na Arch Linux sistemov za popolno pisarniško izkušnjo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs LibreOffice on Arch Linux systems using the Pacman package manager. In addition, it installs the Liberation fonts (ttf-liberation) and language packs corresponding to your chosen LibreOffice flavor. LibreOffice is a powerful and free office suite that provides a comprehensive set of tools for document processing, spreadsheets, presentations, and more."
msgstr "Ta vloga vgrajuje LibreOffice na Arch Linux sistemih z uporabo Pacmanovega upravljalnika paketov. Poleg tega vgrajuje Osvobodilne pisave (osvobajanje) in jezikovne pakete, ki ustrezajo vašim izbranim LibreOffice Okus. LibreOffice je močna in brezplačna pisarniška suita, ki zagotavlja celovit nabor orodij za obdelavo dokumentov, preglednice, predstavitve in še več."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs [caffeine-ng](https://codeberg.org/WhyNotHugo/caffeine-ng), a utility that prevents your GNOME desktop from entering sleep mode or activating the screensaver automatically. It also ensures that caffeine-ng is set to autostart at user login."
msgstr "Ta vloga vgrajuje [kofein-ng](https://codeberg.org/WhyNotHugo/caffeine-ng), pripomoček, ki preprečuje vdor namizja GNOME v način mirovanja ali samodejno aktiviranje ohranjevalnika zaslona. Zagotavlja tudi, da je kofein-ng nastavljen na samodejni zagon ob prijavi uporabnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs `caffeine-ng <https://codeberg.org/WhyNotHugo/caffeine-ng>`__, a utility that prevents your GNOME desktop from entering sleep mode or activating the screensaver automatically. It also ensures that caffeine-ng is set to autostart at user login."
msgstr "Ta vloga vgrajuje `caffeine-ng <https://codeberg.org/WhyNotHugo/caffeine-ng>`__, pripomoček, ki preprečuje vdor namizja GNOME v način mirovanja ali samodejno aktiviranje ohranjevalnika zaslona. Zagotavlja tudi, da je kofein-ng nastavljen na samodejni zagon ob prijavi uporabnika."

msgid "This role installs a systemd service and a daily timer that run the ``garbage_collector.sh`` of every application role deployed on the host in ``routine`` mode. Application roles register their script through ``tasks/utils/install.yml``, which writes one entry per application id below ``DIR_GARBAGE_COLLECTOR_MANIFESTS``. The `disc space cleaner <../sys-ctl-cln-disc-space/README.md>`__ runs the same dispatcher in ``pressure`` mode when a disk crosses its threshold. The destructor stage drops the entries of roles no longer active on the host through ``tasks/decommission.yml``. The script contract and the per-role ``garbage_collector`` declaration are documented in `garbage_collector.sh.md <../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/role/garbage_collector.sh.md>`__."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs a systemd service and a daily timer that run the `garbage_collector.sh` of every application role deployed on the host in `routine` mode. Application roles register their script through `tasks/utils/install.yml`, which writes one entry per application id below `DIR_GARBAGE_COLLECTOR_MANIFESTS`. The [disc space cleaner](../sys-ctl-cln-disc-space/README.md) runs the same dispatcher in `pressure` mode when a disk crosses its threshold. The destructor stage drops the entries of roles no longer active on the host through `tasks/decommission.yml`. The script contract and the per-role `garbage_collector` declaration are documented in [garbage_collector.sh.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/role/garbage_collector.sh.md)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs a systemd service that sends notifications via both [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) and [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) when any service fails."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti sistemsko storitev, ki pošilja obvestila prek obeh [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) ter [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) če katera koli storitev odpove."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs a systemd service that sends notifications via both `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ and `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ when any service fails."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti sistemsko storitev, ki pošilja obvestila prek obeh `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ ter `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ če katera koli storitev odpove."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs an NFS server in one of two flavors, the distro kernel server or userspace nfs-ganesha, selected per deployment. Both export the swarm state path to the resolved addresses of the ``svc-swarm-node`` group and to an additional CIDR allow-list; ganesha also exports the export base and squashes root there. Export options come from ``vars/main.yml`` for the kernel flavor and from the ganesha configuration template for ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integration, and client-side mounting are out of scope; client mounts are handled by ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti strežnik NFS v enem od dveh okusov, distro strežnik jedra ali uporabniški prostor nfs-ganesha, izbran na uporabo. Oba izvoziti rojev države pot na rešene naslove ``svc-swarm-node`` skupina in dodatni seznam dovoljenj CIDR; Ganesha tudi izvozi izvozno osnovo in tam korenine squashes. Izvozne možnosti prihajajo iz ``vars/main.yml`` za okus jedra in iz nastavitvene predloge za ganesho. NFS strežnik HA, Kerberos integracija, in montaža na strani odjemalca so izven področja uporabe; odjemalske nastavke obravnavajo ``svc-storage-nfs-client``."

