msgid "This role installs an NFS server in one of two flavors, the distro kernel server or userspace nfs-ganesha, selected per deployment. Both export the swarm state path to the resolved addresses of the `svc-swarm-node` group and to an additional CIDR allow-list; ganesha also exports the export base and squashes root there. Export options come from `vars/main.yml` for the kernel flavor and from the ganesha configuration template for ganesha. NFS server HA, Kerberos integration, and client-side mounting are out of scope; client mounts are handled by `svc-storage-nfs-client`."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti strežnik NFS v enem od dveh okusov, distro strežnik jedra ali uporabniški prostor nfs-ganesha, izbran na uporabo. Oba izvoziti rojev države pot na rešene naslove `svc-swarm-node` skupina in dodatni seznam dovoljenj CIDR; Ganesha tudi izvozi izvozno osnovo in tam korenine squashes. Izvozne možnosti prihajajo iz `vars/main.yml` za okus jedra in iz nastavitvene predloge za ganesho. NFS strežnik HA, Kerberos integracija, in montaža na strani odjemalca so izven področja uporabe; odjemalske nastavke obravnavajo `svc-storage-nfs-client`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and applies dotlinker (doli) mappings (generic role)."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti in uporablja dotlinker (Doli) Kartiranje (generična vloga)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager (via the community.general.pacman module). In addition, it configures Git for the user by installing a custom git configuration using the [git-configurator](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator) tool. The role ensures that Git is installed and that the configuration tasks are run only once per host."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti in konfigurira Git o ciljnem sistemu z uporabo upravljalnika paketov Pacman (prek community.general.pacman modul). Poleg tega konfigurira Git za uporabnika z namestitvijo nastavitve po meri z uporabo [Konfigurator git](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator) orodje. Vloga zagotavlja, da Git je nameščen in da se nastavitvene naloge izvajajo samo enkrat na gostitelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Git on the target system using the Pacman package manager (via the community.general.pacman module). In addition, it configures Git for the user by installing a custom git configuration using the `git-configurator <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator>`__ tool. The role ensures that Git is installed and that the configuration tasks are run only once per host."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti in konfigurira Git o ciljnem sistemu z uporabo upravljalnika paketov Pacman (prek community.general.pacman modul). Poleg tega konfigurira Git za uporabnika z namestitvijo nastavitve po meri z uporabo `git-configurator <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/git-configurator>`__ orodje. Vloga zagotavlja, da Git je nameščen in da se nastavitvene naloge izvajajo samo enkrat na gostitelja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures Nginx HTTP and stream modules with performance-tuned defaults."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti in konfigurira Nginx HTTP in točne module s privzetimi nastavitvami delovanja."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures VirtualBox and its kernel modules on Pacman-based systems, including extension packs and user group setup."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti in konfigurira VirtualBox in njegove jedrne module na Pacmanovih sistemih, vključno s podaljški paketov in nastavitvami uporabniške skupine."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending email notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the ``{{ system_service_id }}`` service and configures email parameters and templates using msmtp."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti in konfigurira potrebne komponente za pošiljanje e-poštnih obvestil preko sistemad, ko storitev odpove. To postavlja ``{{ system_service_id }}`` storitev in konfigurira e-poštne parametre in predloge z uporabo msmtp."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending email notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the `{{ system_service_id }}` service and configures email parameters and templates using msmtp."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti in konfigurira potrebne komponente za pošiljanje e-poštnih obvestil preko sistemad, ko storitev odpove. To postavlja `{{ system_service_id }}` storitev in konfigurira e-poštne parametre in predloge z uporabo msmtp."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the ``sys-ctl-alm-telegram`` service and configures parameters and customizable templates for sending messages through `Telegram <https://telegram.org>`__."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti in konfigurira potrebne komponente za pošiljanje obvestil preko sistema, ko storitev odpove. To postavlja ``sys-ctl-alm-telegram`` servisira in konfigurira parametre in prilagodljive predloge za pošiljanje sporočil skozi `Telegram <https://telegram.org>`__."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and configures the necessary components for sending notifications via systemd when a service fails. It sets up the `sys-ctl-alm-telegram` service and configures parameters and customizable templates for sending messages through [Telegram](https://telegram.org). <!-- nocheck: url telegram.org answers 404 on the bare root -->"
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti in konfigurira potrebne komponente za pošiljanje obvestil preko sistema, ko storitev odpove. To postavlja `sys-ctl-alm-telegram` servisira in konfigurira parametre in prilagodljive predloge za pošiljanje sporočil skozi [Telegram](https://telegram.org). <!-- nocheck: url telegram.org Odgovori 404 na golem korenu -->"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and maintains the Docker service, including Docker Compose, on Linux systems."
msgstr "Ta vloga vgrajuje in ohranja storitev Docker, vključno z Docker Compose, na Linux sistemih."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and maintains the Docker service, including Docker Compose, on Linux systems.   It is part of the [Infinito.Nexus Project](https://s.infinito.nexus/code), maintained and developed by [Kevin Veen-Birkenbach](https://www.veen.world/)."
msgstr "Ta vloga vgrajuje in ohranja storitev Docker, vključno z Docker Compose, na Linux sistemih. To je del [Infinito.Nexus Projekt](https://s.infinito.nexus/code), vzdržuje in razvija [Kevin Veen-Birkenbach](https://www.veen.world/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs and runs the **cleanback** tool to automatically detect and remove **failed Docker backups**."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti in vodi **čisto nazaj** orodje za samodejno odkrivanje in odstranjevanje **spodletele varnostne kopije Docker**."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs caffeine-ng and configures it to autostart for preventing screen sleep on GNOME."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti kofein-ng in ga nastavite za samodejni zagon za preprečevanje spanja zaslona na GNOME."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs distro-specific equivalents of core build tooling so systems are ready for compiling software from source. After deploying this role, all common build dependencies are available on the system."
msgstr "Ta vloga vključuje distrospecifične ekvivalente orodja za izdelavo jedra, tako da so sistemi pripravljeni za pripravo programske opreme iz vira. Po uveljavitvi te vloge so na sistemu na voljo vse skupne gradbene odvisnosti."

msgid "This role installs one PHP ini (`FILE_PHP_HARDENING_INI`), one interim PHP ini (`FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI`) and one PHP-FPM pool drop-in (`FILE_PHP_FPM_HARDENING_CONF`). A PHP role opts in by declaring a `type: config` entry with that file as `source` and a file inside the scan dir of its image as `target`, e.g. `conf.d/zz-infinito-hardening.ini` or, for the pool, `php-fpm.d/zz-infinito-hardening.conf`. Only roles whose image still ships a PHP release without the CVE-2026-109618 fix also mount `FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI`, as `conf.d/zz-infinito-memory-unlimited.ini`."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs one PHP ini (``FILE_PHP_HARDENING_INI``), one interim PHP ini (``FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI``) and one PHP-FPM pool drop-in (``FILE_PHP_FPM_HARDENING_CONF``). A PHP role opts in by declaring a ``type: config`` entry with that file as ``source`` and a file inside the scan dir of its image as ``target``, e.g. ``conf.d/zz-infinito-hardening.ini`` or, for the pool, ``php-fpm.d/zz-infinito-hardening.conf``. Only roles whose image still ships a PHP release without the CVE-2026-109618 fix also mount ``FILE_PHP_MEMORY_UNLIMITED_INI``, as ``conf.d/zz-infinito-memory-unlimited.ini``."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs or upgrades a Python package **system-wide** using the system ``pip`` (``python3 -m pip``). It is intended for CLI tools that should be available globally (e.g., maintenance utilities)."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti ali nadgradi paket Python **sistemsko** uporaba sistema ``pip`` (``python3 -m pip``). Namenjen je orodjem CLI , ki bi morala biti na voljo po vsem svetu (npr. vzdrževalna podjetja)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs or upgrades a Python package **system-wide** using the system `pip` (`python3 -m pip`). It is intended for CLI tools that should be available globally (e.g., maintenance utilities)."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti ali nadgradi paket Python **sistemsko** uporaba sistema `pip` (`python3 -m pip`). Namenjen je orodjem CLI , ki bi morala biti na voljo po vsem svetu (npr. vzdrževalna podjetja)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the CopyQ clipboard manager on Pacman-based systems (e.g. Arch Linux) and ensures it is started automatically for the current user."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti CopyQ Upravljalnik odložišča na Pacmanovih sistemih (npr. Arch Linux) in zagotavlja, da se samodejno zažene za trenutnega uporabnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the CopyQ clipboard manager on Pacman-based systems (e.g. Arch Linux) and ensures it is started automatically for the current user."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti CopyQ Upravljalnik odložišča na Pacmanovih sistemih (npr. Arch Linux) in zagotavlja, da se samodejno zažene za trenutnega uporabnika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the KeePassXC desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It is intended for personal-workstation roles in the desktop tier and does not configure databases, browser integrations, or autofill helpers."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti KeePassXC namizni program na delovnih postajah, ki temeljijo na Pacmanu, prek upravljalnika sistemskih paketov. Namenjena je osebnim delovnim vlogam v namiznem tiru in ne konfigurira baz podatkov, integracij brskalnika ali pomočnikov za samodejno polnjenje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager in a **secure, reproducible, and idempotent** way across multiple Linux distributions."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti upravitelja paketa Nix v **varno, ponovljivo in navidezno** preko več distribucij Linuxa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager via pacman on Arch x86_64 or via the official installer with SHA256 verification."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti upravitelj paketa Nix preko pacmana na Archu x86_64 ali preko uradnega monterja s SHA256 preverjanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the OBS Studio desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It targets the desktop tier and does not configure scenes, capture devices, or streaming profiles."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti OBS Studio namizni program na delovnih postajah, ki temeljijo na Pacmanu, prek upravljalnika sistemskih paketov. Cilja na namizno stopnjo in ne nastavlja prizorov, naprav za zajemanje ali pretočnih profilov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the SSH client packages required to enable secure remote access and key-based authentication on Linux systems. It ensures that the appropriate SSH client is installed depending on the target distribution and that the installation is executed only once."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti pakete odjemalca SSH, ki so potrebni za omogočanje varnega oddaljenega dostopa in avtentikacijo na Linuxovih sistemih, ki temeljijo na ključih. Zagotavlja, da je ustrezen odjemalec SSH nameščen glede na ciljno porazdelitev in da se naprava izvede samo enkrat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [python-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti [piton-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) paket o ciljnem sistemu. Zagotavlja, da je vodja paketa Pik na voljo za namestitev Python paketov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from `/etc/sudoers.d`."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) paket in uporabi privzeto datoteko sudoers za zagotovitev varnega in doslednega stopnjevanja privilegijev na ciljnem sistemu. Uporablja vnaprej nastavljeno datoteko sudoers, ki sledi najboljšim praksam in vključuje direktive za branje spustnih datotek iz `/etc/sudoers.d`."

msgid "This role installs the ``app-control`` command, writes its configuration, renders the paused page, and, on hosts that also deploy ``web-app-semaphore``, creates the restricted account the Semaphore runner signs in as. The server stage installs all of this once its roles are deployed and before the E2E run; the last step of every deploy applies the persisted pause state of every application on the host. ``sys-svc-compose`` registers each compose instance with it, and the vhost hook in ``sys-front-inj-all`` answers a paused application with HTTP 503 and the paused page."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the ``baudolo`` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via ``tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml``, which they include conditionally once ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` is in ``group_names``. The first seed of a play reads ``databases.csv`` once through ``tasks/05_read-seeded-databases.yml``; a consumer whose row already holds its credentials skips ``baudolo-seed``, every other consumer still calls it at its own point in the play. ``baudolo-seed`` gets the password on stdin (``--password-stdin``), so it never shows in the host’s process list."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the `app-control` command, writes its configuration, renders the paused page, and, on hosts that also deploy `web-app-semaphore`, creates the restricted account the Semaphore runner signs in as. The server stage installs all of this once its roles are deployed and before the E2E run; the last step of every deploy applies the persisted pause state of every application on the host. `sys-svc-compose` registers each compose instance with it, and the vhost hook in `sys-front-inj-all` answers a paused application with HTTP 503 and the paused page."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the `baudolo` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via `tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml`, which they include conditionally once `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is in `group_names`. The first seed of a play reads `databases.csv` once through `tasks/05_read-seeded-databases.yml`; a consumer whose row already holds its credentials skips `baudolo-seed`, every other consumer still calls it at its own point in the play. `baudolo-seed` gets the password on stdin (`--password-stdin`), so it never shows in the host's process list."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ paket o ciljnem sistemu. Zagotavlja, da je vodja paketa Pik na voljo za namestitev Python paketov."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from ``/etc/sudoers.d``."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ paket in uporabi privzeto datoteko sudoers za zagotovitev varnega in doslednega stopnjevanja privilegijev na ciljnem sistemu. Uporablja vnaprej nastavljeno datoteko sudoers, ki sledi najboljšim praksam in vključuje direktive za branje spustnih datotek iz ``/etc/sudoers.d``."

msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), and first waits for the rest of the manipulation group via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/), up to `SYS_TIMEOUT_BACKUP_SERVICES`. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the snapshot tree bounded and [user-backup](../user-backup/) so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), and first waits for the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__, up to ``SYS_TIMEOUT_BACKUP_SERVICES``. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the snapshot tree bounded and `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node`` and probe-mounts the configured ``storage.nfs.server`` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti distroustrezne pakete odjemalcev NFS na vsakega gostitelja v skupini Ansible ``svc-swarm-node`` in priklopi nastavljeno sondo ``storage.nfs.server`` in izvozno osnovo iz svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT za potrditev dosegljivosti in zapisljivosti ob času pošiljanja. Dejanski docker prostorninski nastavki se zgodijo kasneje, poganja pa jih Dockerjev motor ob zagonu posode."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node` and probe-mounts the configured `storage.nfs.server` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Ta vloga namesti distroustrezne pakete odjemalcev NFS na vsakega gostitelja v skupini Ansible `svc-swarm-node` in priklopi nastavljeno sondo `storage.nfs.server` in izvozno osnovo iz svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT za potrditev dosegljivosti in zapisljivosti ob času pošiljanja. Dejanski docker prostorninski nastavki se zgodijo kasneje, poganja pa jih Dockerjev motor ob zagonu posode."

msgid "This role installs the pinned `@openai/codex` CLI on a workstation and manages the connection shared by the CLI and the Codex editor extension in `~/.codex/config.toml`. The `codex-mode` switch it installs selects either the platform's model gateway or the user's own ChatGPT subscription."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role installs the pinned ``@openai/codex`` CLI on a workstation and manages the connection shared by the CLI and the Codex editor extension in ``~/.codex/config.toml``. The ``codex-mode`` switch it installs selects either the platform’s model gateway or the user’s own ChatGPT subscription."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-tuple list (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) consumed by ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no ``meta/addons/`` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, declare them through the unified addon contract under ``meta/addons/`` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "Ta vloga je generični GNOME-razširitev monter, ki ga poganja ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-teple seznam (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) zaužiti ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. Ta ladja nima lastnega betonskega podaljška in se glasi št ``meta/addons/`` datoteke. Vloge, ki prevažajo betonske razširitve GNOME, kot so `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, jih razglasite z enotno pogodbo o dodatku po ``meta/addons/`` (zahteva 026), z eno datoteko na pripono (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); glej to vlogo za primer na datoteko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by `services.gnome-extensions.plugins`, a 3-tuple list (`action`, `uuid`, `url`) consumed by `cli-gnome-extension-manager`. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no `meta/addons/` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as [dsk-gnome](../dsk-gnome/), declare them through the unified addon contract under `meta/addons/` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (`mechanism: extension`, `source: upstream`, `config: { uuid, url }`); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "Ta vloga je generični GNOME-razširitev monter, ki ga poganja `services.gnome-extensions.plugins`, a 3-teple seznam (`action`, `uuid`, `url`) zaužiti `cli-gnome-extension-manager`. Ta ladja nima lastnega betonskega podaljška in se glasi št `meta/addons/` datoteke. Vloge, ki prevažajo betonske razširitve GNOME, kot so [dsk-gnome](../dsk-gnome/), jih razglasite z enotno pogodbo o dodatku po `meta/addons/` (zahteva 026), z eno datoteko na pripono (`mechanism: extension`, `source: upstream`, `config: { uuid, url }`); glej to vlogo za primer na datoteko."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is a group-name tag. It exists so the project's inventory validator accepts `svc-swarm-manager` as a legitimate application_id. The actual swarm-init logic lives in `svc-swarm-node` and dispatches on `'svc-swarm-manager' in group_names`."
msgstr "Ta vloga je oznaka imena skupine. Obstaja tako, da inventar projekta potrjuje `svc-swarm-manager` kot legitimna application_id. Dejanska rojevska logika živi v `svc-swarm-node` in odpreme na `'svc-swarm-manager' in group_names`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is a group-name tag. It exists so the project’s inventory validator accepts ``svc-swarm-manager`` as a legitimate application_id. The actual swarm-init logic lives in ``svc-swarm-node`` and dispatches on ``'svc-swarm-manager' in group_names``."
msgstr "Ta vloga je oznaka imena skupine. Obstaja tako, da inventar projekta potrjuje ``svc-swarm-manager`` kot legitimna application_id. Dejanska rojevska logika živi v ``svc-swarm-node`` in odpreme na ``'svc-swarm-manager' in group_names``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is built on top of your existing ``sys-svc-webserver-core`` role, and it automates the end-to-end process of turning HTTP sites into secure HTTPS sites."
msgstr "Ta vloga je zgrajena na vrhu vašega obstoječega ``sys-svc-webserver-core`` vloga in avtomatizira proces spreminjanja strani HTTP v varna mesta HTTPS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is built on top of your existing `sys-svc-webserver-core` role, and it automates the end-to-end process of turning HTTP sites into secure HTTPS sites."
msgstr "Ta vloga je zgrajena na vrhu vašega obstoječega `sys-svc-webserver-core` vloga in avtomatizira proces spreminjanja strani HTTP v varna mesta HTTPS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is focused on installing JDK 11, but it can be easily modified to install different versions of the JDK or additional Java-related tools as per your requirements."
msgstr "Ta vloga je osredotočena na namestitev JDK 11, vendar ga je mogoče enostavno spremeniti za namestitev različnih različic JDK ali dodatne Java-povezana orodja po vaših zahtevah."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is intended as a shared dependency for other roles that execute OpenSSL commands on the host system."
