msgid "Upstream registries (Docker Hub, quay.io, mcr.microsoft.com, ghcr.io) impose **rate limits** and occasionally have **availability issues**. CI on GitHub-hosted runners also sees **IP-range- and geo-dependent failures**, plus transient `403`, `429`, and `5xx` responses when many jobs pull the same image directly from upstream. This is especially visible with Playwright images sourced from `mcr.microsoft.com`."
msgstr "Zgornji registri (Docker Hub, quay.io, mcr.microsoft.com, ghcr.io) naloži **omejitve stopenj** in občasno **vprašanja dostopnosti**. CI na GitHub-gostujoči tekači tudi vidi **Neuspehi v območju IP in v geo odvisnosti**in prehodnega `403`, `429`, in `5xx` odzivi, kadar veliko delovnih mest potegne isto sliko neposredno iz smeri proti toku. To je še posebej vidno s slikami Playwright, pridobljenimi iz `mcr.microsoft.com`."

