msgid "[Coturn](https://github.com/coturn/coturn) is a free and open-source **TURN (Traversal Using Relays around NAT)** and **STUN (Session Traversal Utilities for NAT)** server.   It enables real-time communication (RTC) applications such as **WebRTC** to work reliably across NATs and firewalls."
msgstr "[Coturn](https://github.com/coturn/coturn) je brezplačna in odprtokodna **TURN (Traversal Uporaba relejev okoli NAT)** ter **ŽITA (Zasedanje Traversal Ustilities za NAT)** strežnik. Omogoča komunikacijo v realnem času (RTC) vloge, kot so **WebRTC** za zanesljivo delovanje prek NAT in požarnih zidov."

