# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[OpenBao](https://openbao.org/) is an identity-based secrets and encryption manager governed by the Linux Foundation. It stores application credentials, API keys, service and database credentials, automation and agent identities, short-lived tokens and encryption keys behind a policy engine, and can act as an internal certificate authority."
msgstr "[OpenBao](https://openbao.org/) je na identiteti temelječa skrivnost in upravljalnik šifriranja, ki ga upravlja fundacija Linux. Shranjuje poverilnice za prijave. API ključi, poverilnice storitev in podatkovne zbirke, avtomatizacija in agentske identitete, kratkotrajni žetoni in šifrirni ključi za političnim motorjem in lahko delujejo kot notranji organ za potrjevanje."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[OpenBao](https://openbao.org/) is the Linux-Foundation-governed fork of HashiCorp Vault: an identity-based secrets and encryption manager with a KV store, a PKI engine, pluggable auth methods and a built-in web UI."
msgstr "[OpenBao](https://openbao.org/) je Linux-Foundation-guverned vilice HashiCorp Vault: na identiteti temelječe skrivnosti in upravljalnik šifriranja z KV trgovina, PKI motor, pluggable Auth metode in vgrajeno spletno UI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/) is an open-source personal AI agent that runs on hardware you control. It ships a gateway process with a browser Control UI next to its CLI and TUI, keeps persistent memory and a workspace on disk, and performs browser and filesystem tasks inside its own sandbox."
msgstr "[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/) je odprtokodni osebni agent, ki deluje na strojni opremi, ki jo nadziraš. Odda proces prehoda z brskalnikom Control UI poleg svojega CLI in TUI, ohranja obstojen pomnilnik in delovni prostor na disku, ter opravlja brskalnik in datotečne naloge znotraj lastnega peskovnika."

