# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] **Clarifying questions only at the start.** Any open question, ambiguity, or missing decision (e.g. Penpot image versions, exporter resource limits, `PENPOT_FLAGS` set, lifecycle starting tier, secrets source) MUST be raised once at the very beginning of the run, in a single batched round, BEFORE any file is changed. Ambiguities discovered mid-run MUST be resolved by the agent using its best judgement, recorded in the role's `README.md` or a code comment, and revisited only at PR review."
msgstr "[x] **Pojasnite vprašanja šele na začetku.** Vsako odprto vprašanje, nejasnost ali manjkajoča odločitev (npr. različice slik Penpot, omejitve virov izvoznika, `PENPOT_FLAGS` set, življenjski cikel začetna stopnja, vir skrivnosti) MORATE dvigniti enkrat na samem začetku delovanja, v enem krogu, preden se spremeni vsaka datoteka. Nejasnosti, odkrite v srednjem teku, mora agent rešiti z uporabo najboljše presoje, zabeležene v vlogi `README.md` ali komentar kodeksa in ponovno pregledan samo pri pregledu PR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] **Clarifying questions only at the start.** Any open question, ambiguity, or missing decision (e.g. which CI runner technology, what the `distribution` parameter switches, how `roles` is interpreted, what the `output stream file` default is, lifecycle starting tier, secrets/registration-token source) MUST be raised once at the very beginning of the run, in a single batched question round, BEFORE any file is changed. Once those questions are answered, the agent MUST NOT pause for further clarification — additional ambiguities discovered mid-run MUST be resolved by the agent using its best judgement, recorded in the role's `README.md` or a code comment, and revisited only at PR review."
msgstr "[x] **Pojasnite vprašanja šele na začetku.** Vsako odprto vprašanje, nejasnost ali manjkajoča odločitev (Na primer katera tehnologija CI, kaj `distribution` Parameter stikala, kako `roles` razlaga, kaj `output stream file` privzeto je, začetna stopnja življenjskega cikla, vir skrivnosti/registracije) MORAJO dvigniti enkrat na samem začetku teče, v enem skupnem vprašanje krog, preden se spremeni vsaka datoteka. Ko se odgovori na ta vprašanja, se agent NE SME ustaviti za nadaljnja pojasnila – dodatne dvoumnosti, odkrite v sredini, mora agent rešiti z uporabo najboljše presoje, zabeležene v vlogi `README.md` ali komentar kodeksa in ponovno pregledan samo pri pregledu PR."

