# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] Ordinary Flowise users cannot use MCP or another HTTP node to reach loopback, metadata endpoints, the container control plane, or unrelated internal services; globally disabling the SSRF check alone fails this criterion. `checkDenyList` resolves a hostname and tests every resolved address, and the built-in list denies all of RFC1918, so reaching any provider on a container network is impossible while the built-in list applies. Upstream's switch is not an off switch: with `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK=false` the deny list becomes exactly `HTTP_DENY_LIST` instead of the built-in one merged with it. The role therefore sets the switch and supplies a list that still denies loopback, link-local, cloud metadata, multicast and reserved space, which is the \"not alone\" this criterion demands. Unrelated internal services are held out by network membership rather than by the list, the same boundary the adapter isolation probe asserts. Configuration alone proves nothing, so the deploy points a throwaway registry entry at loopback and at the metadata address and fails unless Flowise refuses both."
msgstr "[x] Običajno Flowise uporabniki ne morejo uporabljati MCP ali drugega vozlišča HTTP, da bi dosegli zanko, metapodatkovne končne točke, nadzorno ravnino zabojnika ali nepovezane notranje storitve; to merilo na svetovni ravni, ki onemogoča preverjanje SSDF, ne upošteva. `checkDenyList` razreši ime gostitelja in preizkusi vsak rešen naslov, vgrajeni seznam pa zanika vse RFC1918, tako da je nemogoče doseči vsakega ponudnika na kontejnerskem omrežju, medtem ko se uporablja vgrajeni seznam. Stikalo v zgornjem toku ni stikalo za izklop: z `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK=false` seznam zanikanja postane točno `HTTP_DENY_LIST` namesto vgrajenega se je združil z njim. Vloga zato določa stikalo in dobavlja seznam, ki še vedno zanika zankaback, povezavo-lokalno, metapodatkov v oblaku, multicast in rezerviran prostor, ki je \"ne sama\" to merilo zahteva. Nepovezane notranje storitve se izvajajo s članstvom v omrežju in ne s seznamom, ista meja, ki jo določa sonda za izolacijo adapterja. Konfiguracija sama ne dokazuje ničesar, tako da razporeditev točk zavrže vpis registra na zanke in metapodatkov naslov in ne uspe, razen če Flowise zavrne oboje."

