# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] [web-app-wordpress](../../roles/web-app-wordpress/) is audited for a maintained MCP plugin and is integrated only after the plugin's update cadence, license, authentication, and tool scope are documented. The plugin is [WordPress/mcp-adapter](https://github.com/WordPress/mcp-adapter), which bridges the Abilities API to MCP. **Maintained:** owned by the WordPress organisation, not archived, last pushed 2026-08-28. **Cadence:** eight releases between 2025-08-14 and 2026-08-13; the role pins `v0.5.0` (2026-04-15) while `v0.6.1` is current, so the pin trails by two minor versions and is the first thing to revisit. **Licence:** GPL-2.0. **Authentication:** a WordPress application password held in the token store, behind `is_user_logged_in()` and a per-ability permission callback. **Tool scope:** the role registers three read abilities of its own — `infinito/search-posts`, `infinito/get-post`, `infinito/list-categories` — rather than exposing core or third-party abilities, and `files/playwright/addons/infinito-mcp-abilities.spec.js` asserts that exactly those are reachable and that an anonymous `tools/list` is refused. The surface ships `enabled: false`, so it is an operator opt-in."
msgstr "[x] [web-app-wordpress](../../roles/web-app-wordpress/) je revidirana za vzdržuje MCP plugin in je integrirana šele po tem, ko se dokumentira plugin posodobitev kadence, licenca, avtentikacija, in obseg orodja. Vstavek je [WordPress/mcp-adapter](https://github.com/WordPress/mcp-adapter), ki povezuje možnosti API MCP. **Ohranjeno:** v lasti WordPress organizacija, ni arhivirana, nazadnje potisnjena 2026-Kaj?08-Kaj?28. **Cadence:** osem izpustov med 2025-Kaj?08-Kaj?14 ter 2026-Kaj?08-Kaj?13; zatiči vlog; `v0.5.0` (2026-Kaj?04-Kaj?15) med `v0.6.1` je aktualna, tako da pin poti po dveh manjših različicah in je prva stvar, ki se ponovno preuči. **Licenca:** GPL-2.0. **Overovitev:** a WordPress geslo za uporabo, ki se hrani v žetonski trgovini, zadaj `is_user_logged_in()` in dovoljenje za vrnitev. **Obseg orodja:** vloga registrira tri lastne bralne sposobnosti – `infinito/search-posts`, `infinito/get-post`, `infinito/list-categories` — namesto da bi razkrili sposobnosti jedra ali tretje osebe in `files/playwright/addons/infinito-mcp-abilities.spec.js` trdi, da so prav te dosegljive in da anonimni `tools/list` se zavrne. Površinske ladje `enabled: false`, torej je operator opt-in."

