msgstr "`Fider <https://getfider.com/>`__ je odprtokodna platforma za povratne informacije in glasovanje skupnosti, ki omogoča ekipam zbiranje, prioritizacijo in sledenje zahtevam in idejam funkcij."

msgid "`Frappe v16.55.1 (floating: newest tag) <https://github.com/frappe/frappe/blob/v16.55.1/frappe/integrations/oauth2_logins.py#L11-L63>`__ (the image does not name its Frappe version; v16.55.1 was the newest v16 tag when ``frappe/erpnext:v16.53.0`` was pushed), `session_expiry <https://github.com/frappe/frappe/blob/v16.55.1/frappe/core/doctype/system_settings/system_settings.json#L259-L265>`__"
