msgid "`GET` on any path for a user without a usable derived handle renders the form. It prefills the first label `suggestLabel` (`handle.js`) builds from the username, then from the local part of the e-mail address, with middle words cut to their initial (`kevin.veen.birkenbach` becomes `kevin-v-birkenbach`), and previews the full handle `@<label>.<PDS_HANDLE_DOMAIN>` while the user types. The input carries `minlength`, `maxlength` and `CHOSEN_LABEL_PATTERN`, which accept exactly what `chosenLabelError` accepts. The page takes its colours, font and dark mode from the `--design-*` variables the front proxy injects."
msgstr ""

