msgid "```templates/config.exs.j2`` <./templates/config.exs.j2>`__ wires Keycloak as the only login provider this role configures, and the local Mobilizon accounts the role creates in ```tasks/01_design.yml`` <./tasks/01_design.yml>`__ are the platform administrator, which the design spec signs in as, and, while the ``bridge`` of ```web-app-atmo`` <../web-app-atmo/Bridge.md>`__ runs, its account ``atmo_bridge`` with the role ``user``; ``MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN`` (```templates/env.j2`` <./templates/env.j2>`__) additionally closes the database login whenever ``login.method.native`` is off. In the ``services.sso.enabled: false`` matrix variants biber has no account and the shared persona flow types ``ADMIN_USERNAME`` where Mobilizon’s form takes the e-mail, so ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The ``guest`` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
