msgid "`meta/rbac.yml` sets `realm_roles: true`, so Keycloak grants the realm role `web-app-opencloud-<role>` to every `/roles/web-app-opencloud/<role>` group. The container writes `OPENCLOUD_ROLE_ASSIGNMENT` from `vars/main.yml` to `/etc/opencloud/proxy.yaml` at every start, and the proxy then sets the role at every login from `realm_access.roles`. The first matching value wins:"
