msgid "`required` (optional) defaults to `false`. When `required: true`, the addon is part of the role's baseline install contract, is treated as enabled even when `enabled` is omitted, and MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. `required` also gates install-failure handling: a failed install of a `required: true` addon MUST hard-fail the play; a failed install of a `required: false` addon MUST emit a warning, skip the addon, and continue."
msgstr "`required` (neobvezno) privzeto za `false`. Kdaj? `required: true`, addon je del osnovne namestitvene pogodbe vloge, se obravnava kot omogočeno tudi, če `enabled` je izpuščen in NE SME nastaviti `enabled: false`. `required` tudi ravnanje z montažo vrat: neuspešna namestitev `required: true` addon MORA trdo spodleteti igro; neuspešna namestitev a `required: false` Addon MORA oddajati opozorilo, preskočite dodatek in nadaljujte."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`required` is True when some deployed app has the service with both `enabled: true` AND `shared: true`, directly or transitively through its own enabled service dependencies. This is the flag consumers should gate on when deciding whether to load, integrate with, or configure the service. A plain `enabled` flag is not enough on its own, because a service that is enabled but never shared with another app is not actually contractually required by anyone."
msgstr "`required` je res, če ima katera od aplikacij storitev z obema `enabled: true` IN `shared: true`, neposredno ali tranzitno prek lastnih upravičenih storitev. To je zastava, ki bi jo morali potrošniki začeti pri odločanju, ali naj naložijo, se vključijo v storitev ali jo konfigurirajo. Nivo. `enabled` zastava ni dovolj sama po sebi, saj storitev, ki je omogočena, vendar nikoli ne deli z drugo aplikacijo, v resnici ni pogodbeno zahteva."

