# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`services.s1.flavor` selects which implementation answers that contract. `laya` runs [Laya](https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya), the default; `torch` and `onnx` run [jeff](https://github.com/logan-markewich/jeff) over a GLiFormer encoder, which is what the role carried before. Neither upstream ships a container image, so the role builds one and bakes the checkpoints into it. Baking keeps the deploy free of a download at container start, which is the failure mode a sibling role's model pull already hit."
msgstr "`services.s1.flavor` izbere, katera izvedba odgovarja na to pogodbo. `laya` teče [Laya](https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya), privzeto; `torch` ter `onnx` Poženi [Jeff](https://github.com/logan-markewich/jeff) preko kodirnika GLiFormer, kar je bila vloga prej. Niti gornje ladje ne slikajo zabojnikov, zato vloga enega naredi in vanj spečeš kontrolne točke. Pečenje ohranja razporeditev brez prenosa ob zagonu zabojnika, kar je način okvare modelnega potega za vlogo bratov in sester."

